<p></p>
<p></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align: center;"><span lang="EN-IN">At DPS, our approach, strengthened by the vision and support of the Superhouse Group, is to equip students for a future brimming with opportunities. We strive to nurture their academic, social, and emotional growth through an education that blends the richness of Indian culture and values with a global outlook, shaping students into caring and responsible global citizens.</span></p>
