ystem-ui, sans-serif, &quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;, &quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;; font-size: medium;"><div style="text-align: justify;"></div></span>";s:15:"content_heading";s:43:"<div style="text-align: center;"><br></div>";s:15:"table_json_data";N;s:19:"accordion_json_data";N;s:17:"gallery_json_data";N;s:12:"section_type";s:7:"content";s:9:"alignment";s:4:"left";s:16:"background_color";s:7:"#ffffff";s:10:"text_color";s:7:"#333333";s:11:"padding_top";s:2:"50";s:14:"padding_bottom";s:2:"50";s:15:"content_item_id";N;s:17:"content_item_type";N;s:17:"section_layout_id";N;s:7:"columns";a:0:{}}i:2;a:24:{s:2:"id";i:1582;s:5:"title";s:21:"2nd section kalyanpur";s:11:"description";N;s:5:"order";i:3;s:6:"layout";s:7:"content";s:9:"is_active";b:1;s:10:"created_at";s:27:"2025-09-22T05:54:48.010000Z";s:10:"updated_at";s:27:"2026-10-13T09:23:49.617000Z";s:7:"page_id";s:3:"994";s:7:"content";s:6093:"<blockquote style="margin: 0px 0px 0px 40px; padding: 0px; border: medium none currentcolor;">
<div style="text-align: center;">
<p style="text-align: right;"><img style="display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;" src="/upload/images/sections/1791373434_8Z0G3p9CcN.png" alt=""></p>
</div>
</blockquote>
<div style="text-align: center;"><span style="color: #000000; font-size: xx-large;"><span style="font-weight: bolder;">The Delhi Public School Society</span></span></div>
<div style="text-align: justify;">&nbsp;The Delhi Public School Society (DPSS) stands as a distinguished educational institution dedicated to the pursuit of excellence, holistic development and meaningful service to society. As a non-profit, non-proprietary educational organisation, the Society has, over the decades, created a vibrant educational ecosystem where knowledge is complemented by values, creativity is nurtured alongside discipline, and every learner is encouraged to discover their potential.</div>
<div style="text-align: center;"><span style="font-weight: bolder;"><span style="font-size: xx-large;">&nbsp;A Legacy Rooted in Purpose</span></span></div>
<div style="text-align: justify;">&nbsp;The story of the Delhi Public School Society began in 1949, with the establishment of its first school at Mathura Road, New Delhi. What began as a pioneering educational endeavour has grown into a vast and diverse educational network, comprising more than 200 schools in India and abroad, together with its core schools and affiliated institutions across Delhi and the National Capital Region. This remarkable journey reflects a sustained commitment to creating learning environments that are forward looking, inclusive and responsive to the changing needs of society, while remaining firmly anchored in enduring human values.</div>
<div style="text-align: center;"><span style="font-weight: bolder;"><span style="font-size: xx-large;">&nbsp;Leadership with Vision</span></span></div>
<div style="text-align: justify;">&nbsp;Under the able guidance of distinguished leaders such as Shri V. K. Shunglu, Chairman, DPSS, and Shri Ravi Vira Gupta, Vice Chairman, DPSS, the Society continues to advance its vision of providing holistic and quality education to learners from diverse sections of society. The DPS philosophy goes beyond academic achievement. Its institutions strive to nurture self-confident, self-reliant and versatile individuals who possess intellectual curiosity, creativity, resilience, a spirit of adventure and a deep sense of responsibility towards society. The aim is to empower young minds not only to succeed in an increasingly complex world but also to contribute positively to it. Education that Evolves with the Times Recognising that education must continually evolve, DPSS encourages innovation and collaboration across its educational institutions. Its specialised councils and divisions provide valuable platforms for enriching the teaching learning experience. The Council of Educational Planning and Training (CEPT) promotes innovative educational practices and emerging pedagogical trends, supporting teachers and students in embracing new approaches to learning. The Council of Environment Education and Culture (CEEC) fosters environmental awareness among students and encourages them to value, conserve and preserve the natural world. The Society dedicated initiatives in Arts and Heritage, Media and Publications, Sports and Health further broaden the educational experience, ensuring that learning encompasses the intellectual, creative, physical, emotional and social dimensions of a child development.&nbsp;</div>
<div style="text-align: center;"><span style="font-weight: bolder;"><span style="font-size: xx-large;">&nbsp;Education with a Purpose&nbsp;</span></span></div>
<div style="text-align: justify;">&nbsp;For DPSS, education is not confined to classrooms or academic achievement. It is also a means of empowerment, inclusion and social transformation. Through initiatives such as Shiksha Kendra, the Society works towards extending educational opportunities to children from underprivileged sections of society, enabling them to access learning, develop confidence and build pathways towards a more empowered future. Technology and collaboration have also been integral to the Society educational vision. Initiatives such as EDULINKS, a satellite based collaborative learning programme, and LEAP (Learning Exchange and Association Platform) have strengthened interaction, knowledge sharing and collaborative learning among DPS schools, creating a connected educational community that transcends geographical boundaries.&nbsp;</div>
<div style="text-align: center;"><span style="font-weight: bolder;"><span style="font-size: xx-large;">&nbsp;Nurturing Citizens of the Future</span></span></div>
<div style="text-align: justify;">&nbsp;The strength of the Delhi Public School Society lies in its ability to honour its rich educational heritage while embracing the possibilities of the future. Its institutions seek to prepare learners who are academically capable, creatively confident, socially aware and ethically grounded. Through a harmonious blend of knowledge and values, tradition and innovation, discipline and creativity, individual growth and social responsibility, DPSS continues to shape young minds into responsible citizens and future leaders who can engage meaningfully with the challenges and opportunities of the 21st century. The journey of the Delhi Public School Society is, therefore, more than a story of institutional growth. It is a continuing commitment to educate, empower and inspire generations of learners. At the Heart of the DPS Philosophy&nbsp;</div>
<div style="text-align: center;"><span style="font-weight: bolder;"><span style="font-size: xx-large;">&ldquo;SERVICE BEFORE SELF&rdquo;&nbsp;</span></span></div>
<div style="text-align: center;">&nbsp;A timeless principle that inspires learners to pursue excellence while remaining committed to compassion, responsibility and service to society.</div>";s:15:"content_heading";N;s:15:"table_json_data";N;s:19:"accordion_json_data";N;s:17:"gallery_json_data";N;s:12:"section_type";s:7:"content";s:9:"alignment";s:6:"center";s:16:"background_color";s:7:"#ffffff";s:10:"text_color";s:7:"#333333";s:11:"padding_top";s:2:"50";s:14:"padding_bottom";s:2:"50";s:15:"content_item_id";N;s:17:"content_item_type";N;s:17:"section_layout_id";N;s:7:"columns";a:0:{}}}}}s:13:"chairman_data";a:2:{s:7:"success";b:1;s:4:"data";a:20:{s:2:"id";i:998;s:5:"title";s:42:"Pro Vice Chairman's Message Page Kalyanpur";s:16:"meta_description";N;s:13:"meta_keywords";N;s:6:"status";s:9:"published";s:8:"template";s:7:"default";s:10:"created_at";s:27:"2025-09-22T03:34:55.960000Z";s:10:"updated_at";s:27:"2025-09-22T05:58:34.933000Z";s:4:"slug";s:41:"pro-vice-chairmans-message-page-kalyanpur";s:11:"language_id";s:1:"1";s:13:"language_code";s:2:"en";s:17:"translation_group";s:26:"page_group_1758531895_2989";s:8:"language";s:2:"en";s:9:"school_id";s:1:"1";s:9:"branch_id";s:1:"9";s:16:"breadcrumb_style";s:7:"default";s:11:"breadcrumbs";N;s:12:"page_heading";s:42:"Pro Vice Chairman's Message Page Kalyanpur";s:16:"default_sections";s:1:"3";s:8:"sections";a:3:{i:0;a:24:{s:2:"id";i:1584;s:5:"title";s:29:"hero banner section kalyanpur";s:11:"description";N;s:5:"order";i:1;s:6:"layout";s:7:"content";s:9:"is_active";b:1;s:10:"created_at";s:27:"2025-09-22T05:55:23.307000Z";s:10:"updated_at";s:27:"2025-09-22T05:55:23.307000Z";s:7:"page_id";s:3:"998";s:7:"content";N;s:15:"content_heading";s:1668:"<h1 class="sm:text-[32px] sm:block hidden font-[700] text-white text-left sm:mb-1 hr-line relative leading-9 ml-[7rem]" style="--tw-translate-y: 0; --tw-rotate: 0; --tw-skew-x: 0; --tw-skew-y: 0; --tw-scale-x: 1; --tw-scale-y: 1; --tw-pan-x: ; --tw-pan-y: ; --tw-pinch-zoom: ; --tw-scroll-sna