range of clubs and committees that help students explore their interests and develop essential life skills. Academic clubs like STEM and STEAM promote innovation and problem-solving. The Entrepreneurship Club introduces students to business concepts and real-world challenges. Literary clubs enhance communication skills, while cultural and artistic clubs foster creativity. Committees such as the Eco Club, Discipline Committee, and Event Management Committee support a positive and sustainable school environment.</span>";s:12:"content_type";s:4:"text";s:10:"image_path";N;s:9:"image_url";N;s:8:"link_url";N;s:10:"video_path";N;s:9:"video_url";N;s:10:"table_data";N;s:14:"accordion_data";N;s:5:"order";i:1;s:9:"is_active";b:1;s:10:"created_at";s:27:"2025-09-22T07:47:42.567000Z";s:10:"updated_at";s:27:"2025-09-22T07:47:42.567000Z";s:15:"page_section_id";s:4:"1775";s:15:"content_heading";N;s:9:"alignment";N;s:9:"image_alt";N;s:11:"column_type";N;s:5:"width";s:2:"50";s:11:"image_width";N;s:12:"image_height";N;s:15:"content_item_id";N;s:17:"content_item_type";N;}}}i:2;a:24:{s:2:"id";i:1778;s:5:"title";s:44:"Leadership Programme table section kalyanpur";s:11:"description";N;s:5:"order";i:3;s:6:"layout";s:7:"content";s:9:"is_active";b:1;s:10:"created_at";s:27:"2025-09-22T07:48:14.477000Z";s:10:"updated_at";s:27:"2026-05-14T09:38:48.283000Z";s:7:"page_id";s:4:"1099";s:7:"content";s:24000:"<br><div style="text-align: center; "><br></div><blockquote style="margin: 0 0 0 40px; border: none; padding: 0px;"><blockquote style="margin: 0 0 0 40px; border: none; padding: 0px;"><div style="text-align: center; "><table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" width="908" style="width: 681pt;">
