&quot;;">Health and Well-being</h1>";s:15:"table_json_data";N;s:19:"accordion_json_data";N;s:17:"gallery_json_data";N;s:12:"section_type";s:7:"content";s:9:"alignment";s:4:"left";s:16:"background_color";s:7:"#ffffff";s:10:"text_color";s:7:"#333333";s:11:"padding_top";s:2:"50";s:14:"padding_bottom";s:2:"50";s:15:"content_item_id";N;s:17:"content_item_type";N;s:17:"section_layout_id";N;s:7:"columns";a:0:{}}i:1;a:24:{s:2:"id";i:1781;s:5:"title";s:39:"Health and Well-being section kalyanpur";s:11:"description";N;s:5:"order";i:2;s:6:"layout";s:7:"content";s:9:"is_active";b:1;s:10:"created_at";s:27:"2025-09-22T07:49:43.633000Z";s:10:"updated_at";s:27:"2025-09-22T07:49:43.633000Z";s:7:"page_id";s:4:"1102";s:7:"content";N;s:15:"content_heading";N;s:15:"table_json_data";N;s:19:"accordion_json_data";N;s:17:"gallery_json_data";N;s:12:"section_type";s:7:"content";s:9:"alignment";s:4:"left";s:16:"background_color";s:7:"#ffffff";s:10:"text_color";s:7:"#333333";s:11:"padding_top";s:2:"50";s:14:"padding_bottom";s:2:"50";s:15:"content_item_id";N;s:17:"content_item_type";N;s:17:"section_layout_id";N;s:7:"columns";a:2:{i:0;a:25:{s:2:"id";i:699;s:5:"title";s:45:"Health and Well-being image section kalyanpur";s:7:"content";N;s:12:"content_type";s:5:"image";s:10:"image_path";s:79:"https://dps.allenhouseschools.com/upload/images/pages/1772437704_iloqbC7Wzs.png";s:9:"image_url";s:79:"https://dps.allenhouseschools.com/upload/images/pages/1772437704_iloqbC7Wzs.png";s:8:"link_url";N;s:10:"video_path";N;s:9:"video_url";N;s:10:"table_data";N;s:14:"accordion_data";N;s:5:"order";i:1;s:9:"is_active";b:1;s:10:"created_at";s:27:"2025-09-22T07:50:41.597000Z";s:10:"updated_at";s:27:"2026-03-02T07:48:24.507000Z";s:15:"page_section_id";s:4:"1781";s:15:"content_heading";N;s:9:"alignment";N;s:9:"image_alt";N;s:11:"column_type";N;s:5:"width";s:2:"50";s:11:"image_width";N;s:12:"image_height";N;s:15:"content_item_id";N;s:17:"content_item_type";N;}i:1;a:25:{s:2:"id";i:700;s:5:"title";s:44:"Health and Well-being text section kalyanpur";s:7:"content";s:1686:"<p><span style="color: #4b5563; font-family: ui-sans-serif, system-ui, sans-serif, 'Apple Color Emoji', 'Segoe UI Emoji', 'Segoe UI Symbol', 'Noto Color Emoji';">Health and well-being are woven into every aspect of school life. We focus on holistic development, which means caring for the body, nurturing the mind, and building emotional strength. We aim to create a safe, supportive, and healthy environment where every student can thrive. We promote an active lifestyle through:</span><br><br><span style="color: #4b5563; font-family: ui-sans-serif, system-ui, sans-serif, 'Apple Color Emoji', 'Segoe UI Emoji', 'Segoe UI Symbol', 'Noto Color Emoji';">● Daily physical education classes and structured sports programs</span><br><span style="color: #4b5563; font-family: ui-sans-serif, system-ui, sans-serif, 'Apple Color Emoji', 'Segoe UI Emoji', 'Segoe UI Symbol', 'Noto Color Emoji';">● Activities such as yoga, aerobics, athletics, team sports, and martial arts</span><br><span style="color: #4b5563; font-family: ui-sans-serif, system-ui, sans-serif, 'Apple Color Emoji', 'Segoe UI Emoji', 'Segoe UI Symbol', 'Noto Color Emoji';">● Annual Health Check-ups and medical awareness camps</span><br><span style="color: #4b5563; font-family: ui-sans-serif, system-ui, sans-serif, 'Apple Color Emoji', 'Segoe UI Emoji', 'Segoe UI Symbol', 'Noto Color Emoji';">● Nutritious meals and healthy eating habits are encouraged on campus</span><br><span style="color: #4b5563; font-family: ui-sans-serif, system-ui, sans-serif, 'Apple Color Emoji', 'Segoe UI Emoji', 'Segoe UI Symbol', 'Noto Color Emoji';">● Clean, hygienic infrastructure and safe drinking water facilities</span></p>";s:12:"content_type";s:4:"text";s:10:"image_path";N;s:9:"image_url";N;s:8:"link_url";N;s:10:"video_path";N;s:9:"video_url";N;s:10:"table_data";N;s:14:"accordion_data";N;s:5:"order";i:1;s:9:"is_active";b:1;s:10:"created_at";s:27:"2025-09-22T07:51:02.323000Z";s:10:"updated_at";s:27:"2026-10-09T14:35:07.877000Z";s:15:"page_section_id";s:4:"1781";s:15:"content_heading";N;s:9:"alignment";N;s:9:"image_alt";N;s:11:"column_type";N;s:5:"width";s:2:"50";s:11:"image_width";N;s:12:"image_height";N;s:15:"content_item_id";N;s:17:"content_item_type";N;}}}i:2;a:24:{s:2:"id";i:1783;s:5:"title";s:21:"2nd section kalyanpur";s:11:"description";N;s:5:"order";i:3;s:6:"layout";s:7:"content";s:9:"is_active";b:1;s:10:"created_at";s:27:"2025-09-22T07:51:28.550000Z";s:10:"updated_at";s:27:"2025-09-22T07:51:28.550000Z";s:7:"page_id";s:4:"1102";s:7:"content";s:20292:"<span style="color: rgb(75, 85, 99); font-family: ui-sans-serif, system-ui, sans-serif, &quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;, &quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;;">We recognise the importance of emotional health and mental clarity. Our well-being initiatives include:</span><br style="--tw-border-spacing-x: 0; --tw-border-spacing-y: 0; --tw-translate-x: 0; --tw-translate-y: 0; --tw-rotate: 0; --tw-skew-x: 0; --tw-skew-y: 0; --tw-scale-x: 1; --tw-scale-y: 1; --tw-pan-x: ; --tw-pan-y: ; --tw-pinch-zoom: ; --tw-scroll-snap-strictness: proximity; --tw-gradient-from-position: ; --tw-gradient-via-position: ; --tw-gradient-to-position: ; --tw-ordinal: ; --tw-slashed-zero: ; --tw-numeric-figure: ; --tw-numeric-spacing: ; --tw-numeric-fraction: ; --tw-ring-inset: ; --tw-ring-offset-width: 0px; --tw-ring-offset-color: #fff; --tw-ring-color: rgb(59 130 246 / 0.5); --tw-ring-offset-shadow: 0 0 #0000; --tw-ring-shadow: 0 0 #0000; --tw-shadow: 0 0 #0000; --tw-shadow-colored: 0 0 #0000; --tw-blur: ; --tw-brightness: ; --tw-contrast: ; --tw-grayscale: ; --tw-hue-rotate: ; --tw-invert: ; --tw-saturate: ; --tw-sepia: ; --tw-drop-shadow: ; --tw-backdrop-blur: ; --tw-backdrop-brightness: ; --tw-backdrop-contrast: ; --tw-backdrop-grayscale: ; --tw-backdrop-hue-rotate: ; --tw-backdrop-invert: ; --tw-backdrop-opacity: ; --tw-backdrop-saturate: ; --tw-backdrop-sepia: ; --tw-contain-