 font-size: medium;">The cell also works closely with teachers and parents to ensure a supportive ecosystem for every student. Through its continuous efforts, Career Guidance and Counselling Cell strives to nurture confident, responsible, and well-adjusted individuals prepared to meet life’s challenges.</span>";s:12:"content_type";s:4:"text";s:10:"image_path";N;s:9:"image_url";N;s:8:"link_url";N;s:10:"video_path";N;s:9:"video_url";N;s:10:"table_data";N;s:14:"accordion_data";N;s:5:"order";i:1;s:9:"is_active";b:1;s:10:"created_at";s:27:"2025-09-22T08:04:29.030000Z";s:10:"updated_at";s:27:"2025-09-22T08:04:29.030000Z";s:15:"page_section_id";s:4:"1806";s:15:"content_heading";N;s:9:"alignment";N;s:9:"image_alt";N;s:11:"column_type";N;s:5:"width";s:2:"50";s:11:"image_width";N;s:12:"image_height";N;s:15:"content_item_id";N;s:17:"content_item_type";N;}}}i:2;a:24:{s:2:"id";i:22701;s:5:"title";s:34:"STANDARD OPERATING PROCEDURE (SOP)";s:11:"description";N;s:5:"order";i:3;s:6:"layout";s:7:"content";s:9:"is_active";b:1;s:10:"created_at";s:27:"2025-12-08T07:36:18.863000Z";s:10:"updated_at";s:27:"2025-12-08T07:41:06.377000Z";s:7:"page_id";s:4:"1138";s:7:"content";s:19560:"<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align:justify;line-height:15.0pt;mso-layout-grid-align:
none;text-autospace:none"><span style="font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif"><font color="#3c3939" size="4"><br></font></span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align:justify;line-height:15.0pt;mso-layout-grid-align:
none;text-autospace:none"><span style="font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif"><font color="#3c3939" size="4">For
Applying and Issuing Letters of Recommendation (LoRs) <o:p></o:p></font></span></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align:justify;line-height:15.0pt;mso-layout-grid-align:
none;text-autospace:none"><span style="font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif"><font color="#3c3939" size="4">&nbsp;</font></span></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align:justify;line-height:15.0pt;mso-layout-grid-align:
none;text-autospace:none"><b><span style="font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif"><font color="#3c3939" size="4">1. Purpose<o:p></o:p></font></span></b></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align:justify;line-height:15.0pt;mso-layout-grid-align:
none;text-autospace:none"><span style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif;"><font color="#3c3939" size="4">&nbsp;</font></span></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align:justify;line-height:15.0pt;mso-layout-grid-align:
none;text-autospace:none"><span style="font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif"><font color="#3c3939" size="4">To
establish a transparent, uniform, and efficient process for students to request
and receive Letters of Recommendation (LoRs) from teachers, school authorities,
or the principal.<o:p></o:p></font></span></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align:justify;line-height:15.0pt;mso-layout-grid-align:
none;text-autospace:none"><span style="font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif"><font color="#3c3939" size="4">&nbsp;</font></span></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align:justify;line-height:15.0pt;mso-layout-grid-align:
none;text-autospace:none"><b><span style="font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif"><font color="#3c3939" size="4">2. Scope<o:p></o:p></font></span></b></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align:justify;line-height:15.0pt;mso-layout-grid-align:
none;text-autospace:none"><span style="font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif"><font color="#3c3939" size="4">&nbsp;</font></span></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align:justify;line-height:15.0pt;mso-layout-grid-align:
none;text-autospace:none"><span style="font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif"><font color="#3c3939" size="4">Applicable
to all students of Delhi Public School, Kalyanpur, Kanpur who require LoRs for
higher education, scholarships, competitions, exchange programs, or
internships.<o:p></o:p></font></span></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align:justify;line-height:15.0pt;mso-layout-grid-align:
none;text-autospace:none"><span style="font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif"><font color="#3c3939" size="4">Covers
teachers, class coordinators, school counselors, and the principal.<o:p></o:p></font></span></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align:justify;line-height:15.0pt;mso-layout-grid-align:
none;text-autospace:none"><span style="font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif"><font color="#3c3939" size="4">&nbsp;</font></span></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align:justify;line-height:15.0pt;mso-layout-grid-align:
none;text-autospace:none"><b><span style="font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif"><font color="#3c3939" size="4">3. Responsibility Matrix<o:p></o:p></font></span></b></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align:justify;line-height:15.0pt;mso-layout-grid-align:
none;text-autospace:none"><span style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif;"><font color="#3c3939" size="4">&nbsp;</font></span></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align:justify;line-height:15.0pt;mso-layout-grid-align:
none;text-autospace:none"><span style="font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif"><font color="#3c3939" size="4">Student:
Submit request with required details within the timeline.<o:p></o:p></font></span></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align:justify;line-height:15.0pt;mso-layout-grid-align:
none;text-autospace:none"><span style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif;"><font color="#3c3939" size="4">&nbsp;</font></span></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align:justify;line-height:15.0pt;mso-layout-grid-align:
none;text-autospace:none"><span style="font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif"><font color="#3c3939" size="4">Class
Teacher/Subject Teacher: Provide inputs on academics and conduct.<o:p></o:p></font></span></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align:justify;line-height:15.0pt;mso-layout-grid-align:
none;text-autospace:none"><span style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif;"><font color="#3c3939" size="4">&nbsp;</font></span></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align:justify;line-height:15.0pt;mso-layout-grid-align:
none;text-autospace:none"><span style="font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif"><font color="#3c3939" size="4">Counselor/Coordinator:
Review request, guide student on draft/format, and forward for approval.<o:p></o:p></font></span></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align:justify;line-height:15.0pt;mso-layout-grid-align:
none;text-autospace:none"><span style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif;"><font color="#3c3939" size="4">&nbsp;</font></span></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align:justify;line-height:15.0pt;mso-layout-grid-align:
none;text-autospace:none"><span style="font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif"><font color="#3c3939" size="4">Principal/Head
of School: Final signatory of LoR.<o:p></o:p></font></span></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align:justify;line-height:15.0pt;mso-layout-grid-align:
none;text-autospace:none"><span style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif;"><font color="#3c3939" size="4">&nbsp;</font></span></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align:justify;line-height:15.0pt;mso-layout-grid-align:
none;text-autospace:none"><b><span style="font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif"><font color="#3c3939" size="4">4. Procedure<o:p></o:p></font></span></b></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align:justify;line-height:15.0pt;mso-layout-grid-align:
none;text-autospace:none"><span style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif;"><font color="#3c3939" size="4">&nbsp;</font></span></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align:justify;line-height:15.0pt;mso-layout-grid-align:
none;text-autospace:none"><font color="#3c3939" size="4"><b><span style="font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif">Step 1:</span></b><span style="font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif"> Student Request<o:p></o:p></span></font></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align:justify;line-height:15.0pt;mso-layout-grid-align:
none;text-autospace:none"><span style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif;"><font color="#3c3939" size="4">&nbsp;</font></span></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align:justify;line-height:15.0pt;mso-layout-grid-align:
none;text-autospace:none"><span style="font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif"><font color="#3c3939" size="4">1.
Student fills out an LoR Request Form (physical or digital)* at least 3 weeks
in advance.<o:p></o:p></font></span></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align:justify;line-height:15.0pt;mso-layout-grid-align:
none;text-autospace:none"><span style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif;"><font color="#3c3939" size="4">&nbsp;</font></span></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align:justify;line-height:15.0pt;mso-layout-grid-align:
none;text-autospace:none"><span style="font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif"><font color="#3c3939" size="4">2. The
form should include:<o:p></o:p></font></span></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align:justify;line-height:15.0pt;mso-layout-grid-align:
none;text-autospace:none"><span style="font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif"><font color="#3c3939" size="4">Purpose
(college admission, scholarship, competition, etc.)<o:p></o:p></font></span></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align:justify;line-height:15.0pt;mso-layout-grid-align:
none;text-autospace:none"><span style="font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif"><font color="#3c3939" size="4">Name of
institution/program<o:p></o:p></font></span></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align:justify;line-height:15.0pt;mso-layout-grid-align:
none;text-autospace:none"><span style="font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif"><font color="#3c3939" size="4">Deadline
for submission<o:p></o:p></font></span></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align:justify;line-height:15.0pt;mso-layout-grid-align:
none;text-autospace:none"><span style="font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif"><font color="#3c3939" size="4">Student
achievements (academic, extracurricular, leadership, community service)<o:p></o:p></font></span></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align:justify;line-height:15.0pt;mso-layout-grid-align:
none;text-autospace:none"><span style="font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif"><font color="#3c3939" size="4">Any
specific qualities/skills to be highlighted<o:p></o:p></font></span></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align:justify;line-height:15.0pt;mso-layout-grid-align:
none;text-autospace:none"><span style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif;"><font color="#3c3939" size="4">&nbsp;</font></span></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align:justify;line-height:15.0pt;mso-layout-grid-align:
none;text-autospace:none"><font color="#3c3939" size="4"><b><span style="font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif">Step 2:</span></b><span style="font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif"> Teacher/Counselor Review<o:p></o:p></span></font></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align:justify;line-height:15.0pt;mso-layout-grid-align:
none;text-autospace:none"><span style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif;"><font color="#3c3939" size="4">&nbsp;</font></span></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align:justify;line-height:15.0pt;mso-layout-grid-align:
none;text-autospace:none"><span style="font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif"><font color="#3c3939" size="4">1. The
counselor/class teacher verifies the student’s achievements and conduct.<o:p></o:p></font></span></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align:justify;line-height:15.0pt;mso-layout-grid-align:
none;text-autospace:none"><span style="font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif"><font color="#3c3939" size="4">2.
Teacher provides feedback/input to be included in the LoR.<o:p></o:p></font></span></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align:justify;line-height:15.0pt;mso-layout-grid-align:
none;text-autospace:none"><span style="font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif"><font color="#3c3939" size="4">3. Draft
is prepared by the counselor/concerned teacher (or using school’s standard LoR <o:p></o:p></font></span></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align:justify;line-height:15.0pt;mso-layout-grid-align:
none;text-autospace:none"><span style="font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif"><font color="#3c3939" size="4">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; template available with Mr. Aditya.<o:p></o:p></font></span></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align:justify;line-height:15.0pt;mso-layout-grid-align:
none;text-autospace:none"><span style="font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif"><font color="#3c3939" size="4">&nbsp;</font></span></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align:justify;line-height:15.0pt;mso-layout-grid-align:
none;text-autospace:none"><b style="color: rgb(60, 57, 57); font-size: large;"><span style="font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif">Step 3:</span></b><span style="color: rgb(60, 57, 57); font-size: large; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;"> Draft &amp; Approval</span></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align:justify;line-height:15.0pt;mso-layout-grid-align:
none;text-autospace:none"><span style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif;"><font color="#3c3939" size="4">&nbsp;</font></span></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align:justify;line-height:15.0pt;mso-layout-grid-align:
none;text-autospace:none"><span style="font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif"><font color="#3c3939" size="4">1. Draft
LoR is shared with the principal for review.<o:p></o:p></font></span></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align:justify;line-height:15.0pt;mso-layout-grid-align:
none;text-autospace:none"><span style="font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif"><font color="#3c3939" size="4">2.
Principal suggests changes if necessary.<o:p></o:p></font></span></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align:justify;line-height:15.0pt;mso-layout-grid-align:
none;text-autospace:none"><span style="font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif"><font color="#3c3939" size="4">3. Once
approved, the final LoR is typed on school letterhead with seal and signature.<o:p></o:p></font></span></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align:justify;line-height:15.0pt;mso-layout-grid-align:
none;text-autospace:none"><span style="font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif"><font color="#3c3939" size="4">&nbsp;</font></span></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align:justify;line-height:15.0pt;mso-layout-grid-align:
none;text-autospace:none"><font color="#3c3939" size="4"><b><span style="font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif">Step 4:</span></b><span style="font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif"> Issuance<o:p></o:p></span></font></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align:justify;line-height:15.0pt;mso-layout-grid-align:
none;text-autospace:none"><span style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif;"><font color="#3c3939" size="4">&nbsp;</font></span></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align:justify;line-height:15.0pt;mso-layout-grid-align:
none;text-autospace:none"><span style="font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif"><font color="#3c3939" size="4">1. LoR
is sent directly to the requesting institution via official school email.<o:p></o:p></font></span></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align:justify;line-height:15.0pt;mso-layout-grid-align:
none;text-autospace:none"><span style="font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif"><font color="#3c3939" size="4">&nbsp;</font></span></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align:justify;line-height:15.0pt;mso-layout-grid-align:
none;text-autospace:none"><span style="font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif"><font color="#3c3939" size="4">2.
Record of all issued LoRs is maintained in the LoR Register (date, student
name, purpose, destination).<o:p></o:p></font></span></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align:justify;line-height:15.0pt;mso-layout-grid-align:
none;text-autospace:none"><span style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif;"><font color="#3c3939" size="4">&nbsp;</font></span></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align:justify;line-height:15.0pt;mso-layout-grid-align:
none;text-autospace:none"><font color="#3c3939" size="4"><b><span style="font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif">Step 5.</span></b><span style="font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif"> Timelines<o:p></o:p></span></font></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align:justify;line-height:15.0pt;mso-layout-grid-align:
none;text-autospace:none"><span style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif;"><font color="#3c3939" size="4">&nbsp;</font></span></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align:justify;line-height:15.0pt;mso-layout-grid-align:
none;text-autospace:none"><span style="font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif"><font color="#3c3939" size="4">Request
submission: Minimum 3 weeks before deadline<o:p></o:p></font></span></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align:justify;line-height:15.0pt;mso-layout-grid-align:
none;text-autospace:none"><span style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif;"><font color="#3c3939" size="4">&nbsp;</font></span></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align:justify;line-height:15.0pt;mso-layout-grid-align:
none;text-autospace:none"><span style="font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif"><font color="#3c3939" size="4">Draft
preparation &amp; review: 14 working days<o:p></o:p></font></span></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align:justify;line-height:15.0pt;mso-layout-grid-align:
none;text-autospace:none"><span style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif;"><font color="#3c3939" size="4">&nbsp;</font></span></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align:justify;line-height:15.0pt;mso-layout-grid-align:
