ock hidden font-[700] text-white text-left sm:mb-1 hr-line relative leading-9 ml-[7rem]" style="--tw-translate-y: 0; --tw-rotate: 0; --tw-skew-x: 0; --tw-skew-y: 0; --tw-scale-x: 1; --tw-scale-y: 1; --tw-pan-x: ; --tw-pan-y: ; --tw-pinch-zoom: ; --tw-scroll-snap-strictness: proximity; --tw-gradient-from-position: ; --tw-gradient-via-position: ; --tw-gradient-to-position: ; --tw-ordinal: ; --tw-slashed-zero: ; --tw-numeric-figure: ; --tw-numeric-spacing: ; --tw-numeric-fraction: ; --tw-ring-inset: ; --tw-ring-offset-width: 0px; --tw-ring-offset-color: #fff; --tw-ring-color: rgb(59 130 246 / 0.5); --tw-ring-offset-shadow: 0 0 #0000; --tw-ring-shadow: 0 0 #0000; --tw-shadow: 0 0 #0000; --tw-shadow-colored: 0 0 #0000; --tw-blur: ; --tw-brightness: ; --tw-contrast: ; --tw-grayscale: ; --tw-hue-rotate: ; --tw-invert: ; --tw-saturate: ; --tw-sepia: ; --tw-drop-shadow: ; --tw-backdrop-blur: ; --tw-backdrop-brightness: ; --tw-backdrop-contrast: ; --tw-backdrop-grayscale: ; --tw-backdrop-hue-rotate: ; --tw-backdrop-invert: ; --tw-backdrop-opacity: ; --tw-backdrop-saturate: ; --tw-backdrop-sepia: ; --tw-contain-size: ; --tw-contain-layout: ; --tw-contain-paint: ; --tw-contain-style: ; border-width: 0px; border-style: solid; border-color: rgb(229, 231, 235); font-size: 32px; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0.25rem; margin-left: 7rem; position: relative; line-height: 2.25rem; --tw-text-opacity: 1; color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: ui-sans-serif, system-ui, sans-serif, &quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;, &quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;;">FAQ's</h1>";s:15:"table_json_data";N;s:19:"accordion_json_data";N;s:17:"gallery_json_data";N;s:12:"section_type";s:7:"content";s:9:"alignment";s:4:"left";s:16:"background_color";s:7:"#ffffff";s:10:"text_color";s:7:"#333333";s:11:"padding_top";s:2:"50";s:14:"padding_bottom";s:2:"50";s:15:"content_item_id";N;s:17:"content_item_type";N;s:17:"section_layout_id";N;s:7:"columns";a:0:{}}i:1;a:24:{s:2:"id";i:2008;s:5:"title";s:23:"FAQ's section kalyanpur";s:11:"description";N;s:5:"order";i:2;s:6:"layout";s:7:"content";s:9:"is_active";b:1;s:10:"created_at";s:27:"2025-09-22T09:26:03.023000Z";s:10:"updated_at";s:27:"2026-10-08T04:58:38.607000Z";s:7:"page_id";s:4:"1254";s:7:"content";s:92205:"<h3 class="text-[20px] font-[700] text-gray-600 mt-5" style="--tw-border-spacing-x: 0; --tw-border-spacing-y: 0; --tw-translate-x: 0; --tw-translate-y: 0; --tw-rotate: 0; --tw-skew-x: 0; --tw-skew-y: 0; --tw-scale-x: 1; --tw-scale-y: 1; --tw-scroll-snap-strictness: proximity; --tw-ring-offset-width: 0px; --tw-ring-offset-color: #fff; --tw-ring-color: rgb(59 130 246 / 0.5); --tw-ring-offset-shadow: 0 0 #0000; --tw-ring-shadow: 0 0 #0000; --tw-shadow: 0 0 #0000; --tw-shadow-colored: 0 0 #0000; font-size: 20px; margin-top: 1.25rem; margin-bottom: 0px; --tw-text-opacity: 1; color: #4b5563; font-family: ui-sans-serif, system-ui, sans-serif, 'Apple Color Emoji', 'Segoe UI Emoji', 'Segoe UI Symbol', 'Noto Color Emoji'; border: 0px solid #e5e7eb;">1. What grades does Delhi Public School, Kalyanpur offer?</h3>
<p class="sm:text-[16px] text-[16px] text-gray-600 font-[400] mt-2" style="--tw-border-spacing-x: 0; --tw-border-spacing-y: 0; --tw-translate-x: 0; --tw-translate-y: 0; --tw-rotate: 0; --tw-skew-x: 0; --tw-skew-y: 0; --tw-scale-x: 1; --tw-scale-y: 1; --tw-scroll-snap-strictness: proximity; --tw-ring-offset-width: 0px; --tw-ring-offset-color: #fff; --tw-ring-color: rgb(59 130 246 / 0.5); --tw-ring-offset-shadow: 0 0 #0000; --tw-ring-shadow: 0 0 #0000; --tw-shadow: 0 0 #0000; --tw-shadow-colored: 0 0 #0000; margin-top: 0.5rem; margin-bottom: 0px; font-size: medium; --tw-text-opacity: 1; color: #4b5563; font-family: ui-sans-serif, system-ui, sans-serif, 'Apple Color Emoji', 'Segoe UI Emoji', 'Segoe UI Symbol', 'Noto Color Emoji'; border: 0px solid #e5e7eb;">Ans: Delhi Public School, Kalyanpur, Kanpur offers a comprehensive educational journey from Class PG-12, providing continuous learning and holistic development at every stage of a student's academic life.</p>
<h3 class="text-[20px] font-[700] text-gray-600 mt-5" style="--tw-border-spacing-x: 0; --tw-border-spacing-y: 0; --tw-translate-x: 0; --tw-translate-y: 0; --tw-rotate: 0; --tw-skew-x: 0; --tw-skew-y: 0; --tw-scale-x: 1; --tw-scale-y: 1; --tw-scroll-snap-strictness: proximity; --tw-ring-offset-width: 0px; --tw-ring-offset-color: #fff; --tw-ring-color: rgb(59 130 246 / 0.5); --tw-ring-offset-shadow: 0 0 #0000; --tw-ring-shadow: 0 0 #0000; --tw-shadow: 0 0 #0000; --tw-shadow-colored: 0 0 #0000; font-size: 20px; margin-top: 1.25rem; margin-bottom: 0px; --tw-text-opacity: 1; color: #4b5563; font-family: ui-sans-serif, system-ui, sans-serif, 'Apple Color Emoji', 'Segoe UI Emoji', 'Segoe UI Symbol', 'Noto Color Emoji'; border: 0px solid #e5e7eb;">2. How do I enroll my child at Delhi Public School Kalyanpur?</h3>
<p class="sm:text-[16px] text-[16px] text-gray-600 font-[400] mt-2" style="--tw-border-spacing-x: 0; --tw-border-spacing-y: 0; --tw-translate-x: 0; --tw-translate-y: 0; --tw-rotate: 0; --tw-skew-x: 0; --tw-skew-y: 0; --tw-scale-x: 1; --tw-scale-y: 1; --tw-scroll-snap-strictness: proximity; --tw-ring-offset-width: 0px; --tw-ring-offset-color: #fff; --tw-ring-color: rgb(59 130 246 / 0.5); --tw-ring-offset-shadow: 0 0 #0000; --tw-ring-shadow: 0 0 #0000; --tw-shadow: 0 0 #0000; --tw-shadow-colored: 0 0 #0000; margin-top: 0.5rem; margin-bottom: 0px; font-size: medium; --tw-text-opacity: 1; color: #4b5563; font-family: ui-sans-serif, system-ui, sans-serif, 'Apple Color Emoji', 'Segoe UI Emoji', 'Segoe UI Symbol', 'Noto Color Emoji'; border: 0px solid #e5e7eb;">Ans: Visit the Admissions section on the school website and complete the Online Registration Form. Link-&nbsp;<span style="font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; color: #212529;">- </span><a href="https://dpskal.superhouseerp.com/RegistrationTransaction/OnlineRegistration" style="font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, sans-serif; font-size: 16px;"><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;">Online Registration</span></a></p>
<p class="sm:text-[16px] text-[16px] text-gray-600 font-[400] mt-2" style="--tw-border-spacing-x: 0; --tw-border-spacing-y: 0; --tw-translate-x: 0; --tw-translate-y: 0; --tw-rotate: 0; --tw-skew-x: 0; --tw-skew-y: 0; --tw-scale-x: 1; --tw-scale-y: 1; --tw-scroll-snap-strictness: proximity; --tw-ring-offset-width: 0px; --tw-ring-offset-color: #fff; --tw-ring-color: rgb(59 130 246 / 0.5); --tw-ring-offset-shadow: 0 0 #0000; --tw-ring-shadow: 0 0 #0000; --tw-shadow: 0 0 #0000; --tw-shadow-colored: 0 0 #0000; margin-top: 0.5rem; margin-bottom: 0px; font-size: medium; --tw-text-opacity: 1; color: #4b5563; font-family: ui-sans-serif, system-ui, sans-serif, 'Apple Color Emoji', 'Segoe UI Emoji', 'Segoe UI Symbol', 'Noto Color Emoji'; border: 0px solid #e5e7eb;"><span style="font-size: 20px; font-weight: 600;">Or visit the school campus for admission assistance:</span></p>
<p class="sm:text-[16px] text-[16px] text-gray-600 font-[400] mt-2" style="--tw-border-spacing-x: 0; --tw-border-spacing-y: 0; --tw-translate-x: 0; --tw-translate-y: 0; --tw-rotate: 0; --tw-skew-x: 0; --tw-skew-y: 0; --tw-scale-x: 1; --tw-scale-y: 1; --tw-scroll-snap-strictness: proximity; --tw-ring-offset-width: 0px; --tw-ring-offset-color: #fff; --tw-ring-color: rgb(59 130 246 / 0.5); --tw-ring-offset-shadow: 0 0 #0000; --tw-ring-shadow: 0 0 #0000; --tw-shadow: 0 0 #0000; --tw-shadow-colored: 0 0 #0000; margin-top: 0.5rem; margin-bottom: 0px; font-size: medium; --tw-text-opacity: 1; color: #4b5563; font-family: ui-sans-serif, system-ui, sans-serif, 'Apple Color Emoji', 'Segoe UI Emoji', 'Segoe UI Symbol', 'Noto Color Emoji'; border: 0px solid #e5e7eb;"></p>
<ul>
<li>Monday to Friday: 7:45 a.m. &ndash; 4:00 p.m.&nbsp;</li>
<li>Saturday: 7:45 a.m. &ndash; 3:00 p.m. (except holidays)</li>
<li>Contact the school through the official phone numbers for admission-related queries. (Admission Counsellors: 9044055605, 9580362555, Reception: 8810712544) &bull; Access the admission form through the Online Registration link&nbsp;<span style="font-size: 20px; font-weight: 600;"></span><span style="color: #212529; font-size: 11pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;">-</span><span style="color: #212529; font-size: 11pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;"><a href="https://dpskal.superhouseerp.com/RegistrationTransaction/OnlineRegistration"><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;">Online Registration</span></a></span></li>
</ul>
<p></p>
<p class="sm:text-[16px] text-[16px] text-gray-600 font-[400] mt-2" style="--tw-border-spacing-x: 0; --tw-border-spacing-y: 0; --tw-translate-x: 0; --tw-translate-y: 0; --tw-rotate: 0; --tw-skew-x: 0; --tw-skew-y: 0; --tw-scale-x: 1; --tw-scale-y: 1; --tw-scroll-snap-strictness: proximity; --tw-ring-offset-width: 0px; --tw-ring-offset-color: #fff; --tw-ring-color: rgb(59 130 246 / 0.5); --tw-ring-offset-shadow: 0 0 #0000; --tw-ring-shadow: 0 0 #0000; --tw-shadow: 0 0 #0000; --tw-shadow-colored: 0 0 #0000; margin-top: 0.5rem; margin-bottom: 0px; font-size: medium; --tw-text-opacity: 1; color: #4b5563; font-family: ui-sans-serif, system-ui, sans-serif, 'Apple Color Emoji', 'Segoe UI Emoji', 'Segoe UI Symbol', 'Noto Color Emoji'; border: 0px solid #e5e7eb;"><span style="font-size: 20px; font-weight: 600;">3. What are the school timings?</span></p>
