<p class="sm:text-[16px] text-[16px] text-gray-600 font-[400] mt-2" style="--tw-border-spacing-x: 0; --tw-border-spacing-y: 0; --tw-translate-x: 0; --tw-translate-y: 0; --tw-rotate: 0; --tw-skew-x: 0; --tw-skew-y: 0; --tw-scale-x: 1; --tw-scale-y: 1; --tw-scroll-snap-strictness: proximity; --tw-ring-offset-width: 0px; --tw-ring-offset-color: #fff; --tw-ring-color: rgb(59 130 246 / 0.5); --tw-ring-offset-shadow: 0 0 #0000; --tw-ring-shadow: 0 0 #0000; --tw-shadow: 0 0 #0000; --tw-shadow-colored: 0 0 #0000; margin-top: 0.5rem; margin-bottom: 0px; font-size: medium; --tw-text-opacity: 1; color: #4b5563; font-family: ui-sans-serif, system-ui, sans-serif, 'Apple Color Emoji', 'Segoe UI Emoji', 'Segoe UI Symbol', 'Noto Color Emoji'; border: 0px solid #e5e7eb;"><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif; text-align: justify; font-size: 16px; color: #212529;">The school office remains open until 4:00 p.m. to assist parents and visitors with admissions and other administrative queries.</span></p>
<p class="sm:text-[16px] text-[16px] text-gray-600 font-[400] mt-2" style="--tw-border-spacing-x: 0; --tw-border-spacing-y: 0; --tw-translate-x: 0; --tw-translate-y: 0; --tw-rotate: 0; --tw-skew-x: 0; --tw-skew-y: 0; --tw-scale-x: 1; --tw-scale-y: 1; --tw-scroll-snap-strictness: proximity; --tw-ring-offset-width: 0px; --tw-ring-offset-color: #fff; --tw-ring-color: rgb(59 130 246 / 0.5); --tw-ring-offset-shadow: 0 0 #0000; --tw-ring-shadow: 0 0 #0000; --tw-shadow: 0 0 #0000; --tw-shadow-colored: 0 0 #0000; margin-top: 0.5rem; margin-bottom: 0px; font-size: medium; --tw-text-opacity: 1; color: #4b5563; font-family: ui-sans-serif, system-ui, sans-serif, 'Apple Color Emoji', 'Segoe UI Emoji', 'Segoe UI Symbol', 'Noto Color Emoji'; border: 0px solid #e5e7eb;"><span style="font-size: 20px; font-weight: 600;">4. Which board is the school affiliated with?</span></p>
<p class="sm:text-[16px] text-[16px] text-gray-600 font-[400] mt-2" style="--tw-border-spacing-x: 0; --tw-border-spacing-y: 0; --tw-translate-x: 0; --tw-translate-y: 0; --tw-rotate: 0; --tw-skew-x: 0; --tw-skew-y: 0; --tw-scale-x: 1; --tw-scale-y: 1; --tw-scroll-snap-strictness: proximity; --tw-ring-offset-width: 0px; --tw-ring-offset-color: #fff; --tw-ring-color: rgb(59 130 246 / 0.5); --tw-ring-offset-shadow: 0 0 #0000; --tw-ring-shadow: 0 0 #0000; --tw-shadow: 0 0 #0000; --tw-shadow-colored: 0 0 #0000; margin-top: 0.5rem; margin-bottom: 0px; font-size: medium; --tw-text-opacity: 1; color: #4b5563; font-family: ui-sans-serif, system-ui, sans-serif, 'Apple Color Emoji', 'Segoe UI Emoji', 'Segoe UI Symbol', 'Noto Color Emoji'; border: 0px solid #e5e7eb;">Ans:&nbsp;<span style="font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; color: #212529;">Delhi Public School, Kalyanpur is affiliated with the Central Board of Secondary Education (CBSE), New Delhi, under Affiliation No. 2130477.</span></p>
<h3 class="text-[20px] font-[700] text-gray-600 mt-5" style="--tw-border-spacing-x: 0; --tw-border-spacing-y: 0; --tw-translate-x: 0; --tw-translate-y: 0; --tw-rotate: 0; --tw-skew-x: 0; --tw-skew-y: 0; --tw-scale-x: 1; --tw-scale-y: 1; --tw-scroll-snap-strictness: proximity; --tw-ring-offset-width: 0px; --tw-ring-offset-color: #fff; --tw-ring-color: rgb(59 130 246 / 0.5); --tw-ring-offset-shadow: 0 0 #0000; --tw-ring-shadow: 0 0 #0000; --tw-shadow: 0 0 #0000; --tw-shadow-colored: 0 0 #0000; font-size: 20px; margin-top: 1.25rem; margin-bottom: 0px; --tw-text-opacity: 1; color: #4b5563; font-family: ui-sans-serif, system-ui, sans-serif, 'Apple Color Emoji', 'Segoe UI Emoji', 'Segoe UI Symbol', 'Noto Color Emoji'; border: 0px solid #e5e7eb;">5. What is the student teacher ratio at DPS Kalyanpur?</h3>
<p class="sm:text-[16px] text-[16px] text-gray-600 font-[400] mt-2" style="--tw-border-spacing-x: 0; --tw-border-spacing-y: 0; --tw-translate-x: 0; --tw-translate-y: 0; --tw-rotate: 0; --tw-skew-x: 0; --tw-skew-y: 0; --tw-scale-x: 1; --tw-scale-y: 1; --tw-scroll-snap-strictness: proximity; --tw-ring-offset-width: 0px; --tw-ring-offset-color: #fff; --tw-ring-color: rgb(59 130 246 / 0.5); --tw-ring-offset-shadow: 0 0 #0000; --tw-ring-shadow: 0 0 #0000; --tw-shadow: 0 0 #0000; --tw-shadow-colored: 0 0 #0000; margin-top: 0.5rem; margin-bottom: 0px; font-size: medium; --tw-text-opacity: 1; color: #4b5563; font-family: ui-sans-serif, system-ui, sans-serif, 'Apple Color Emoji', 'Segoe UI Emoji', 'Segoe UI Symbol', 'Noto Color Emoji'; border: 0px solid #e5e7eb;">Ans: At Delhi Public School, Kalyanpur, we strive to maintain an optimal student teacher ratio to ensure quality education and personalized attention. The student teacher ratio in the Foundational Wing is 20:1, while the Preparatory, Middle, Senior, and Senior Secondary Wings maintain a student teacher ratio of approximately 35:1.</p>
<h3 class="text-[20px] font-[700] text-gray-600 mt-5" style="--tw-border-spacing-x: 0; --tw-border-spacing-y: 0; --tw-translate-x: 0; --tw-translate-y: 0; --tw-rotate: 0; --tw-skew-x: 0; --tw-skew-y: 0; --tw-scale-x: 1; --tw-scale-y: 1; --tw-scroll-snap-strictness: proximity; --tw-ring-offset-width: 0px; --tw-ring-offset-color: #fff; --tw-ring-color: rgb(59 130 246 / 0.5); --tw-ring-offset-shadow: 0 0 #0000; --tw-ring-shadow: 0 0 #0000; --tw-shadow: 0 0 #0000; --tw-shadow-colored: 0 0 #0000; font-size: 20px; margin-top: 1.25rem; margin-bottom: 0px; --tw-text-opacity: 1; color: #4b5563; font-family: ui-sans-serif, system-ui, sans-serif, 'Apple Color Emoji', 'Segoe UI Emoji', 'Segoe UI Symbol', 'Noto Color Emoji'; border: 0px solid #e5e7eb;">6. What extracurricular activities are available?</h3>
<p class="sm:text-[16px] text-[16px] text-gray-600 font-[400] mt-2" style="--tw-border-spacing-x: 0; --tw-border-spacing-y: 0; --tw-translate-x: 0; --tw-translate-y: 0; --tw-rotate: 0; --tw-skew-x: 0; --tw-skew-y: 0; --tw-scale-x: 1; --tw-scale-y: 1; --tw-scroll-snap-strictness: proximity; --tw-ring-offset-width: 0px; --tw-ring-offset-color: #fff; --tw-ring-color: rgb(59 130 246 / 0.5); --tw-ring-offset-shadow: 0 0 #0000; --tw-ring-shadow: 0 0 #0000; --tw-shadow: 0 0 #0000; --tw-shadow-colored: 0 0 #0000; margin-top: 0.5rem; margin-bottom: 0px; font-size: medium; --tw-text-opacity: 1; color: #4b5563; font-family: ui-sans-serif, system-ui, sans-serif, 'Apple Color Emoji', 'Segoe UI Emoji', 'Segoe UI Symbol', 'Noto Color Emoji'; border: 0px solid #e5e7eb;">Ans:&nbsp;</p>
<p class="sm:text-[16px] text-[16px] text-gray-600 font-[400] mt-2" style="--tw-border-spacing-x: 0; --tw-border-spacing-y: 0; --tw-translate-x: 0; --tw-translate-y: 0; --tw-rotate: 0; --tw-skew-x: 0; --tw-skew-y: 0; --tw-scale-x: 1; --tw-scale-y: 1; --tw-scroll-snap-strictness: proximity; --tw-ring-offset-width: 0px; --tw-ring-offset-color: #fff; --tw-ring-color: rgb(59 130 246 / 0.5); --tw-ring-offset-shadow: 0 0 #0000; --tw-ring-shadow: 0 0 #0000; --tw-shadow: 0 0 #0000; --tw-shadow-colored: 0 0 #0000; margin-top: 0.5rem; margin-bottom: 0px; font-size: medium; --tw-text-opacity: 1; color: #4b5563; font-family: ui-sans-serif, system-ui, sans-serif, 'Apple Color Emoji', 'Segoe UI Emoji', 'Segoe UI Symbol', 'Noto Color Emoji'; border: 0px solid #e5e7eb;"></p>
<ul>
<li>Life Skills Programmes: Financial Literacy, Oluxi Smart Skills.&nbsp;</li>
<li>Creative Activities: Animation, Robotics, Dance, Music.&nbsp;</li>
<li>Sports &amp; Fitness: Gymnasium, Northwest Sports Academy, NCC, School offers more than 15 games which includes</li>
