<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: 0in; text-align: center; line-height: normal;" align="center"><strong><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; color: black; mso-themecolor: text1;">Tennis</span></strong></p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td width="684" colspan="5" valign="top" style="width: 513pt; border-width: medium 4.5pt 4.5pt; border-style: none double double; border-color: currentcolor windowtext windowtext; background: #d2eaf1; padding: 0in 5.4pt;">
<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: 0in; text-align: center; line-height: normal; mso-yfti-cnfc: 68;" align="center"><strong><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; color: black; mso-themecolor: text1;">Yoga</span></strong></p>
</td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
</div>
<p class="sm:text-[16px] text-[16px] text-gray-600 font-[400] mt-2" style="--tw-border-spacing-x: 0; --tw-border-spacing-y: 0; --tw-translate-x: 0; --tw-translate-y: 0; --tw-rotate: 0; --tw-skew-x: 0; --tw-skew-y: 0; --tw-scale-x: 1; --tw-scale-y: 1; --tw-scroll-snap-strictness: proximity; --tw-ring-offset-width: 0px; --tw-ring-offset-color: #fff; --tw-ring-color: rgb(59 130 246 / 0.5); --tw-ring-offset-shadow: 0 0 #0000; --tw-ring-shadow: 0 0 #0000; --tw-shadow: 0 0 #0000; --tw-shadow-colored: 0 0 #0000; margin-top: 0.5rem; margin-bottom: 0px; font-size: medium; --tw-text-opacity: 1; color: #4b5563; font-family: ui-sans-serif, system-ui, sans-serif, 'Apple Color Emoji', 'Segoe UI Emoji', 'Segoe UI Symbol', 'Noto Color Emoji'; border: 0px solid #e5e7eb;"></p>
<ul>
<li>Academic Enrichment: Olympiads, Cambridge English Assessment (Optional).&nbsp;</li>
<li>Leadership &amp; Engagement: Student Clubs, House System, Debates, Leadership Development Programme.</li>
<li>&nbsp; Events &amp; Competitions: Workshops, co-curricular activities, and Panorama (Annual Techno-Cultural Festival).&nbsp;</li>
<li>Participation in district, state, national, and international competitions.&nbsp;</li>
<li>Age-appropriate activity rooms and sports facilities for holistic development.&nbsp;</li>
<li>For more details, visit the school website or contact the Admissions Department. (Admission Counsellors: 9044055605, 9580362555)</li>
</ul>
<p></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: 0in; text-align: justify;"><strong><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;">Q8. Does DPS Kalyanpur offer lunch or cafeteria services?</span></strong><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;"></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: 0in;"><strong><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;">Ans:</span></strong><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;"> Yes, the school has an on campus cafeteria.</span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l1 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list .25in; margin: 0in 0in 0in .25in;"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style="font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;">&middot;<span style="font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;">Serves wholesome, nutritious, and delicious meals.</span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l1 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list .25in; margin: 0in 0in 0in .25in;"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style="font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;">&middot;<span style="font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;">Maintains high standards of hygiene, cleanliness, and food safety.</span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l1 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list .25in; margin: 0in 0in 0in .25in;"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style="font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;">&middot;<span style="font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;">Ensures meals are prepared in a clean and well-maintained environment.</span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l1 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list .25in; margin: 0in 0in 0in .25in;"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style="font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;">&middot;<span style="font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;">Prioritizes the health and well-being of students.</span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: 0in; text-align: justify;"><strong><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;">Q9. How often are Parent Teacher Meetings (PTMs) conducted?</span></strong><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;"></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: 0in; text-align: justify;"><strong><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;">Ans:</span></strong><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;"> Parent Teacher Meetings (PTMs) are conducted once every quarter and are generally scheduled before/after each major assessment. Typically, the school organises six PTMs during an academic year to discuss students' academic progress, overall development, and areas for improvement with parents.</span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: 0in;"><strong><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;">Q10. How is technology education integrated into the school system?</span></strong><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;"></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: 0in;"><strong><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;">Ans:</span></strong><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;"> Offers a comprehensive technology education programme.</span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l2 level1 lfo2; tab-stops: list .25in; margin: 0in 0in 0in .25in;"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style="font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;">&middot;<span style="font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;">Curriculum includes Computer Science, Animation, Robotics, and Artificial Intelligence (AI).</span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l2 level1 lfo2; tab-stops: list .25in; margin: 0in 0in 0in .25in;"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style="font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;">&middot;<span style="font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;">Provides hands-on learning experiences through practical activities.</span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l2 level1 lfo2; tab-stops: list .25in; margin: 0in 0in 0in .25in;"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style="font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;">&middot;<span style="font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;">Develops digital literacy and technological skills.</span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l2 level1 lfo2; tab-stops: list .25in; margin: 0in 0in 0in .25in;"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style="font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;">&middot;<span style="font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;">Provision of Interactive Panels.</span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l2 level1 lfo2; tab-stops: list .25in; margin: 0in 0in 0in .25in;"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style="font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;">&middot;<span style="font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;">Prepares students for a technology driven future.</span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: 0in; text-align: justify;"><strong><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;">Q11. Does Delhi Public School, Kalyanpur provide medical facilities on campus?</span></strong><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;"></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: 0in;"><strong><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;">Ans:</span></strong><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;"> Yes, the school has a well-equipped on-campus infirmary.</span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l4 level1 lfo3; tab-stops: list .25in; margin: 0in 0in 0in .25in;"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style="font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;">&middot;<span style="font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;">Staffed by a full-time qualified school nurse.</span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l4 level1 lfo3; tab-stops: list .25in; margin: 0in 0in 0in .25in;"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style="font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;">&middot;<span style="font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;">Provides first aid and immediate medical assistance during school hours.</span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l4 level1 lfo3; tab-stops: list .25in; margin: 0in 0in 0in .25in;"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style="font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;">&middot;<span style="font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;">Equipped with essential medical supplies for illness and minor injuries.</span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l4 level1 lfo3; tab-stops: list .25in; margin: 0in 0in 0in .25in;"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style="font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;">&middot;<span style="font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;">Ensures prompt healthcare support for students.</span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: 0in; text-align: justify;"><strong><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;">Q12. Why is Delhi Public School, Kalyanpur so famous?</span></strong><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;"></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: 0in;"><strong><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;">Ans:</span></strong><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;"></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo4; tab-stops: list .25in; margin: 0in 0in 0in .25in;"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style="font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;">&middot;<span style="font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;">Known for academic excellence and holistic development.</span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo4; tab-stops: list .25in; margin: 0in 0in 0in .25in;"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style="font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;">&middot;<span style="font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;">Offers value based education in a nurturing and disciplined environment.</span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo4; tab-stops: list .25in; margin: 0in 0in 0in .25in;"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style="font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;">&middot;<span style="font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;">Supported by highly qualified educators, modern infrastructure, and innovative teaching practices.</span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo4; tab-stops: list .25in; margin: 0in 0in 0in .25in;"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style="font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;">&middot;<span style="font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;">Provides a balanced focus on academics, sports, performing arts, leadership, technology, and life skills.</span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo4; tab-stops: list .25in; margin: 0in 0in 0in .25in;"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style="font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;">&middot;<span style="font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;">Emphasizes character building, critical thinking, and future readiness.</span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo4; tab-stops: list .25in; margin: 0in 0in 0in .25in;"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style="font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;">&middot;<span style="font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;">Trusted by parents and the community as a leading educational institution in the region.</span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo4; tab-stops: list .25in; margin: 0in 0in 0in .25in;"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style="font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;">&middot;<span style="font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;">Enhances and focuses value development and community service as its motto &ldquo;<strong>Service Before Self</strong>&rdquo; </span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: 0in; text-align: justify;"><strong><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;">Q13. How does Delhi Public School Kalyanpur ensure student safety and security?</span></strong><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;"></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: 0in;"><strong><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;">Ans:</span></strong><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;"></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l3 level1 lfo5; tab-stops: list .25in; margin: 0in 0in 0in .25in;"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style="font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;">&middot;<span style="font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;">Campus is monitored through CCTV surveillance.</span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l3 level1 lfo5; tab-stops: list .25in; margin: 0in 0in 0in .25in;"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style="font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;">&middot;<span style="font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;">Supported by trained security personnel.</span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l3 level1 lfo5; tab-stops: list .25in; margin: 0in 0in 0in .25in;"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style="font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;">&middot;<span style="font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;">Follows a well-defined safety management system.</span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l3 level1 lfo5; tab-stops: list .25in; margin: 0in 0in 0in .25in;"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style="font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;">&middot;<span style="font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;">Teaching and support staff receive regular emergency response training.</span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l3 level1 lfo5; tab-stops: list .25in; margin: 0in 0in 0in .25in;"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style="font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;">&middot;<span style="font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;">Conducts periodic safety and mock drills.</span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l3 level1 lfo5; tab-stops: list .25in; margin: 0in 0in 0in .25in;"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style="font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;">&middot;<span style="font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;">Maintains strict visitor management procedures.</span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l3 level1 lfo5; tab-stops: list .25in; margin: 0in 0in 0in .25in;"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style="font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;">&middot;<span style="font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;">Ensures a safe, secure, and caring environment for all students.</span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: 0in; text-align: justify;"><strong><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;">Q14. Who leads the Delhi Public School Society?</span></strong><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;"></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: 0in; text-align: justify;"><strong><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;">Ans:</span></strong><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;"> The Delhi Public School Society (DPSS) is guided by the visionary leadership of Mr. Shri V. K. Shunglu (Chairman) and Mr. Ravi Vira Gupta&nbsp; (Vice Chairman). The Society is committed to providing holistic, value based, and quality education, inspired by its enduring motto, &lsquo;<strong>Service Before Self</strong>.&rsquo;</span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: 0in; text-align: justify;"><strong><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;">Q15. Who is the Principal of DPS Kalyanpur, Kanpur?</span></strong><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;"></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: 0in; text-align: justify;"><strong><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;">Ans</span></strong><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;">: Dr. Richa Prakash is the Principal of Delhi Public School, Kalyanpur, Kanpur. An accomplished educator, visionary academic leader and author of the book &lsquo;Women In Ancient India&rsquo;, she is an alumna of Lady Shri Ram College for Women, University of Delhi, and holds a Doctorate. With extensive experience in educational leadership, Dr. Richa Prakash has been recognised and honoured by various organisations and professional platforms for her outstanding contributions to the field of education. Under her dynamic leadership, Delhi Public School Kalyanpur continues to foster academic excellence, innovation, holistic development and a student centric learning environment.&nbsp;</span></p>
<h2 class="text-[24px] font-[700] text-blue-main text-center mt-5" style="--tw-border-spacing-x: 0; --tw-border-spacing-y: 0; --tw-translate-x: 0; --tw-translate-y: 0; --tw-rotate: 0; --tw-skew-x: 0; --tw-skew-y: 0; --tw-scale-x: 1; --tw-scale-y: 1; --tw-scroll-snap-strictness: proximity; --tw-ring-offset-width: 0px; --tw-ring-offset-color: #fff; --tw-ring-color: rgb(59 130 246 / 0.5); --tw-ring-offset-shadow: 0 0 #0000; --tw-ring-shadow: 0 0 #0000; --tw-shadow: 0 0 #0000; --tw-shadow-colored: 0 0 #0000; font-size: 24px; margin-top: 1.25rem; margin-bottom: 0px; color: #005224; font-family: ui-sans-serif, system-ui, sans-serif, 'Apple Color Emoji', 'Segoe UI Emoji', 'Segoe UI Symbol', 'Noto Color Emoji'; border: 0px solid #e5e7eb;">ADMISSION</h2>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: 0in; text-align: justify;"><strong><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;">Q16. What is the fee structure of the school?</span></strong><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;"></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: 0in; text-align: justify;"><strong><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;">Ans:</span></strong><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;"> Detailed information regarding the fee structure of Delhi Public School Kalyanpur is available on the school's official website. Link-</span><a href="https://dpskalyanpur.com/fee-structure-page-kalyanpur"><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;">DPS Kalyanpur Fee Structure | CBSE School Admission Fees</span></a><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;"> .</span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: 0in; text-align: justify;"><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;">You may also contact the school office for any additional queries or clarification regarding fees and the admission process.</span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: 0in; text-align: justify;"><strong><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;">Q17. Is there an admission fee?</span></strong><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;"></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: 0in; text-align: justify;"><strong><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;">Ans:</span></strong><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;"> Yes. Delhi Public School Kalyanpur charges a one time, non-refundable admission fee as follows:</span></p>
<ul style="margin-top: 0in;" type="disc">
<li class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: 0in; text-align: justify; mso-list: l1 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list .5in;"><strong><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;">Playgroup to Class X:</span></strong><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;"> ₹30,000/-</span></li>
<li class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: 0in; text-align: justify; mso-list: l1 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list .5in;"><strong><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;">Classes XI and XII:</span></strong><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;"> ₹35,000/-</span></li>
</ul>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: 0in; text-align: justify;"><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;">For complete details regarding the admission process, fee structure, and payment guidelines, please visit the Admissions section of the school's official website or contact the school office. Link-</span><a href="https://dpskalyanpur.com/fee-structure-page-kalyanpur"><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;">DPS Kalyanpur Fee Structure | CBSE School Admission Fees</span></a><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;"></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: 0in; text-align: justify;"><strong><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;">Q18. What is the age criterion for admission?</span></strong><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;"></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: 0in; text-align: justify;"><strong><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;">Ans:</span></strong><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;"> The age eligibility for admission varies according to the class for which admission is sought. For detailed age criteria and admission requirements, please visit the Admissions section of the official Delhi Public School, Kalyanpur website or contact the school admissions office. Link-</span><a href="https://dpskalyanpur.com/admission-criteria"><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;">Admission Criteria Page Kalyanpur</span></a><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;"></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: 0in; text-align: justify;"><strong><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;">Q19. Can I transfer my child to DPS Kalyanpur during the academic year?</span></strong><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;"></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: 0in; text-align: justify;"><strong><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;">Ans:</span></strong><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;"> Yes, mid-term admissions may be considered on a case by case basis, subject to seat availability, the student's academic record, and compliance with the school's admission policies. Parents are encouraged to contact the Admissions Office for guidance on eligibility, the admission process, and the required documentation.</span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: 0in; text-align: justify;"><strong><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;">Q20. What documents are required for admission?</span></strong><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;"></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: 0in; text-align: justify;"><strong><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;">Ans:</span></strong><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;"> The following documents are required at the time of admission to Delhi Public School Kalyanpur:</span></p>
<ul style="margin-top: 0in;" type="disc">
<li class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: 0in; text-align: justify; mso-list: l2 level1 lfo2; tab-stops: list .5in;"><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;">Birth Certificate issued by the Municipal Corporation (Nagar Nigam).</span></li>
<li class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: 0in; text-align: justify; mso-list: l2 level1 lfo2; tab-stops: list .5in;"><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;">Four recent passport size photographs of the student.</span></li>
<li class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: 0in; text-align: justify; mso-list: l2 level1 lfo2; tab-stops: list .5in;"><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;">Recent passport size photographs of both the parents.</span></li>
<li class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: 0in; text-align: justify; mso-list: l2 level1 lfo2; tab-stops: list .5in;"><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;">Aadhaar Card copies of the student and both the parents.</span></li>
<li class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: 0in; text-align: justify; mso-list: l2 level1 lfo2; tab-stops: list .5in;"><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;">Caste Certificate (if applicable).</span></li>
<li class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: 0in; text-align: justify; mso-list: l2 level1 lfo2; tab-stops: list .5in;"><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;">PEN (Permanent Education Number) issued by the previous school (where applicable).</span></li>
<li class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: 0in; text-align: justify; mso-list: l2 level1 lfo2; tab-stops: list .5in;"><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;">Transfer Certificate (TC) or School Leaving Certificate (SLC) from the previous school.</span></li>
<li class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: 0in; text-align: justify; mso-list: l2 level1 lfo2; tab-stops: list .5in;"><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;">Final Report Card/Mark Sheet of the previous class.</span></li>
<li class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: 0in; text-align: justify; mso-list: l2 level1 lfo2; tab-stops: list .5in;"><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;">Medical records or relevant medical documents, if applicable.</span></li>
</ul>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: 0in; text-align: justify;"><strong><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;">Q21. Is there an entrance exam for admission?</span></strong><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;"></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: 0in; text-align: justify;"><strong><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;">Ans:</span></strong><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;"> Yes. The admission process at Delhi Public School&nbsp; Kalyanpur includes age appropriate assessments based on the class for which admission is sought.</span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align: justify; text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo3; tab-stops: list .25in; margin: 0in 0in 0in .25in;"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style="font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;">&middot;<span style="font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]--><strong><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;">Playgroup to Class II:</span></strong><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;"> Admission is based on observation and interaction with the child. No written entrance examination is conducted.</span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align: justify; text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo3; tab-stops: list .25in; margin: 0in 0in 0in .25in;"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style="font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;">&middot;<span style="font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]--><strong><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;">Classes III to IX &amp; XI:</span></strong><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;"> Admission includes a written entrance examination, followed by interaction and observation as part of the selection process.</span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align: justify; text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo3; tab-stops: list .25in; margin: 0in 0in 0in .25in;"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style="font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;">&middot;<span style="font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]--><strong><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;">Classes X &amp; XII: </span></strong><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;">Direct Admission based on CBSE direct admission guidelines. CBSE Link-</span> <a href="https://www.cbse.gov.in/examin~1/admissionmt.htm">ADMISSION OF STUDENTS TO A SCHOOL</a><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;"></span></p>
<h3 class="text-[20px] font-[700] text-gray-600 mt-5" style="--tw-border-spacing-x: 0; --tw-border-spacing-y: 0; --tw-translate-x: 0; --tw-translate-y: 0; --tw-rotate: 0; --tw-skew-x: 0; --tw-skew-y: 0; --tw-scale-x: 1; --tw-scale-y: 1; --tw-scroll-snap-strictness: proximity; --tw-ring-offset-width: 0px; --tw-ring-offset-color: #fff; --tw-ring-color: rgb(59 130 246 / 0.5); --tw-ring-offset-shadow: 0 0 #0000; --tw-ring-shadow: 0 0 #0000; --tw-shadow: 0 0 #0000; --tw-shadow-colored: 0 0 #0000; font-size: 20px; margin-top: 1.25rem; margin-bottom: 0px; --tw-text-opacity: 1; color: #4b5563; font-family: ui-sans-serif, system-ui, sans-serif, 'Apple Color Emoji', 'Segoe UI Emoji', 'Segoe UI Symbol', 'Noto Color Emoji'; border: 0px solid #e5e7eb;"><span style="font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: EN-US; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;">Parents will be informed of the dates and schedule for the observation, interaction, and entrance examination well in advance.</span></h3>
<h2 class="text-[24px] font-[700] text-blue-main text-center mt-5" style="--tw-border-spacing-x: 0; --tw-border-spacing-y: 0; --tw-translate-x: 0; --tw-translate-y: 0; --tw-rotate: 0; --tw-skew-x: 0; --tw-skew-y: 0; --tw-scale-x: 1; --tw-scale-y: 1; --tw-scroll-snap-strictness: proximity; --tw-ring-offset-width: 0px; --tw-ring-offset-color: #fff; --tw-ring-color: rgb(59 130 246 / 0.5); --tw-ring-offset-shadow: 0 0 #0000; --tw-ring-shadow: 0 0 #0000; --tw-shadow: 0 0 #0000; --tw-shadow-colored: 0 0 #0000; font-size: 24px; margin-top: 1.25rem; margin-bottom: 0px; color: #005224; font-family: ui-sans-serif, system-ui, sans-serif, 'Apple Color Emoji', 'Segoe UI Emoji', 'Segoe UI Symbol', 'Noto Color Emoji'; border: 0px solid #e5e7eb;">TRANSPORTATION</h2>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: 0in;"><strong><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;">Q22. Does DPS Kalyanpur offer transportation services?</span></strong><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;"></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: 0in;"><strong><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;">Ans:</span></strong><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;"> Yes, the school provides safe and reliable transportation services across various locations in Kanpur.</span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo2; tab-stops: list .25in; margin: 0in 0in 0in .25in;"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style="font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;">&middot;<span style="font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;">Operates a well-managed fleet of school buses.</span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo2; tab-stops: list .5in; margin: 0in 0in 0in .25in;"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style="font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;">&middot;<span style="font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;">Each bus is staffed by trained personnel and follows established safety protocols.</span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: 0in; text-align: justify;"><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;">For bus routes, pick-up/drop-off points, and transportation fees, contact the Transport Office or visit the Admissions section of the school website. Link of the bus route-</span> <a href="https://dpskalyanpur.com/bus-routes"><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;">Bus Routes Page Kalyanpur</span></a><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;"></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo2; tab-stops: list .5in; margin: 0in 0in 0in .25in;"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style="font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;">&middot;<span style="font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]--><strong><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;">Email:</span></strong><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;"> </span><a href="mailto:assistance@dpskalyanpur.com"><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;">assistance@dpskalyanpur.com</span></a><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;"> or </span><a href="mailto:transportcoordinator@dpskalyanpur.com"><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;">transportcoordinator@dpskalyanpur.com</span></a><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;"></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: 0in; text-align: justify;"><strong><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;">Q23. Which areas are covered by the school bus service?</span></strong><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;"></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: 0in; text-align: justify;"><strong><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;">Ans:</span></strong></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align: justify; text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l5 level1 lfo3; tab-stops: list .25in .5in; margin: 0in 0in 0in .25in;"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style="font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;">&middot;<span style="font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;">Bus services are available across Kanpur and surrounding areas, subject to route availability.</span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align: justify; text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l5 level1 lfo3; tab-stops: list .25in; margin: 0in 0in 0in .25in;"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style="font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;">&middot;<span style="font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;">Covers multiple designated pick-up and drop-off points.</span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align: justify; text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l5 level1 lfo3; tab-stops: list .25in; margin: 0in 0in 0in .25in;"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style="font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;">&middot;<span style="font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;">For the complete list of bus routes and schedules, visit the Bus Routes page on the school website.</span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l3 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list .25in; margin: 0in 0in 0in .25in;"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style="font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;">&middot;<span style="font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;">You may also contact the Transport Office for route-related assistance (<strong>Admission Counsellors:</strong> 9044055605, 9580362555)</span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: 0in; text-align: justify;"><strong><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;">Link of the bus route-</span></strong><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;"> </span><a href="https://dpskalyanpur.com/bus-routes"><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;">Bus Routes Page Kalyanpur</span></a><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;"></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: 0in;"><strong><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;">Q24. What are the school bus timings?</span></strong></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: 0in;"><strong><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;">Ans:</span></strong><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;"> School buses operate according to the school schedule.</span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l2 level1 lfo4; tab-stops: list .25in; margin: 0in 0in 0in .25in;"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style="font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;">&middot;<span style="font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;">Buses depart immediately after school dispersal.</span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l2 level1 lfo4; tab-stops: list .25in; margin: 0in 0in 0in .25in;"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style="font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;">&middot;<span style="font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;">Pick-up and drop-off timings vary depending on the assigned route and boarding location.</span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l2 level1 lfo4; tab-stops: list .25in; margin: 0in 0in 0in .25in;"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style="font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;">&middot;<span style="font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;">Parents may contact the Transport Office for route-specific bus timings.</span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: 0in; text-align: justify;"><strong><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;">Q25. Are the school buses safe and well-maintained?</span></strong><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;"></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: 0in;"><strong><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;">Ans:</span></strong><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;"> Yes, student safety is a top priority.</span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l1 level1 lfo5; tab-stops: list .25in; margin: 0in 0in 0in .25in;"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style="font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;">&middot;<span style="font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;">Buses are equipped with GPS tracking, CCTV surveillance, and first-aid kits.</span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l1 level1 lfo5; tab-stops: list .25in; margin: 0in 0in 0in .25in;"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style="font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;">&middot;<span style="font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;">Undergo regular safety inspections and preventive maintenance.</span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l1 level1 lfo5; tab-stops: list .25in; margin: 0in 0in 0in .25in;"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style="font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;">&middot;<span style="font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;">Operated by trained drivers and support staff.</span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l1 level1 lfo5; tab-stops: list .25in; margin: 0in 0in 0in .25in;"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style="font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;">&middot;<span style="font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;">Follow established safety protocols to ensure safe and comfortable travel.</span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: 0in; text-align: justify;"><strong><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;">Q26. Do the school buses have trained staff?</span></strong><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;"></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: 0in; text-align: justify;"><strong><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;">Ans:</span></strong><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;"> Yes, every bus is operated by a trained and experienced driver.</span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align: justify; text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l4 level1 lfo6; tab-stops: list .25in; margin: 0in 0in 0in .25in;"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style="font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;">&middot;<span style="font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;">Each bus is accompanied by a trained bus attendant.</span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align: justify; text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l4 level1 lfo6; tab-stops: list .25in; margin: 0in 0in 0in .25in;"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style="font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;">&middot;<span style="font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;">Ensures student safety, supervision, and well-being throughout the journey.</span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align: justify; text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l4 level1 lfo6; tab-stops: list .25in; margin: 0in 0in 0in .25in;"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style="font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;">&middot;<span style="font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;">Transportation staff are trained to follow safety protocols and respond to emergencies.</span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: 0in; text-align: justify;"><strong><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;">Q27. Who should I contact for transportation-related queries or issues?</span></strong><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;"></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: 0in; text-align: justify;"><strong><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;">Ans:</span></strong><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;"> Contact the Transport Office during school working hours.</span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align: justify; text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l6 level1 lfo7; tab-stops: list .25in; margin: 0in 0in 0in .25in;"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style="font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;">&middot;<span style="font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;">Reach the School Reception by phone or visit the campus for assistance.</span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align: justify; text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l6 level1 lfo7; tab-stops: list .25in; margin: 0in 0in 0in .25in;"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style="font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;">&middot;<span style="font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;">Get help with bus routes, timings, transportation services, and related queries.</span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align: justify; text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l6 level1 lfo7; tab-stops: list .25in; margin: 0in 0in 0in .25in;"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style="font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;">&middot;</span><strong><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;">Email:</span></strong><a href="mailto:assistance@dpskalyanpur.com"><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;">assistance@dpskalyanpur.com</span></a>&nbsp;<span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;">or&nbsp;</span><a href="mailto:transportcoordinator@dpskalyanpur.com"><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;">transportcoordinator@dpskalyanpur.com</span></a><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;"></span></p>
