<p style="line-height: 1.7999999999999998; text-align: justify; margin-top: 10pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">Daily commute time</span></p>
</td>
<td style="vertical-align: top; padding: 5pt 5pt 5pt 5pt; overflow: hidden; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: solid #000000 0.5pt;" bis_size="{&quot;x&quot;:211,&quot;y&quot;:2417,&quot;w&quot;:180,&quot;h&quot;:56,&quot;abs_x&quot;:577,&quot;abs_y&quot;:3383}">
<p style="line-height: 1.7999999999999998; text-align: justify; margin-top: 10pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">60 to 120 minutes lost</span></p>
</td>
<td style="vertical-align: top; padding: 5pt 5pt 5pt 5pt; overflow: hidden; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: solid #000000 0.5pt;" bis_size="{&quot;x&quot;:392,&quot;y&quot;:2417,&quot;w&quot;:225,&quot;h&quot;:56,&quot;abs_x&quot;:758,&quot;abs_y&quot;:3383}">
<p style="line-height: 1.7999999999999998; text-align: justify; margin-top: 10pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">None</span></p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr style="height: 25pt;" bis_size="{&quot;x&quot;:22,&quot;y&quot;:2473,&quot;w&quot;:595,&quot;h&quot;:85,&quot;abs_x&quot;:388,&quot;abs_y&quot;:3439}">
<td style="vertical-align: top; padding: 5pt 5pt 5pt 5pt; overflow: hidden; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: solid #000000 0.5pt;" bis_size="{&quot;x&quot;:22,&quot;y&quot;:2473,&quot;w&quot;:189,&quot;h&quot;:85,&quot;abs_x&quot;:388,&quot;abs_y&quot;:3439}">
<p style="line-height: 1.7999999999999998; text-align: justify; margin-top: 10pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">Evening study environment</span></p>
</td>
