DG 3 and SDG 4.";s:6:"school";a:29:{s:2:"id";i:1;s:4:"name";s:19:"Delhi Public School";s:11:"description";s:19:"Delhi Public School";s:4:"logo";s:0:"";s:7:"website";s:0:"";s:5:"email";s:0:"";s:5:"phone";s:0:"";s:7:"address";s:0:"";s:4:"city";s:0:"";s:5:"state";s:0:"";s:7:"country";s:0:"";s:11:"postal_code";s:0:"";s:14:"principal_name";s:0:"";s:15:"principal_email";s:0:"";s:15:"principal_phone";s:0:"";s:16:"established_year";N;s:13:"accreditation";s:0:"";s:7:"mission";s:0:"";s:6:"vision";s:0:"";s:11:"core_values";s:0:"";s:6:"status";s:6:"active";s:10:"meta_title";s:0:"";s:16:"meta_description";s:0:"";s:13:"meta_keywords";s:0:"";s:8:"language";N;s:11:"language_id";s:1:"1";s:10:"created_at";s:27:"2025-08-07T20:31:54.000000Z";s:10:"updated_at";s:27:"2025-12-13T17:21:25.200000Z";s:4:"slug";s:18:"delhi-public-scool";}s:6:"branch";a:30:{s:2:"id";i:9;s:4:"name";s:9:"Kalyanpur";s:11:"description";s:13:"Dps Kalyanpur";s:11:"branch_code";s:0:"";s:7:"address";s:66:"287-295, Bithoor Rd, Singhpur, Kalyanpur,
Kanpur, Gangpur Kachhar";s:4:"city";s:6:"Kanpur";s:5:"state";s:13:"Uttar Pradesh";s:7:"country";s:0:"";s:11:"postal_code";s:6:"208017";s:5:"phone";s:31:"+91 9044055605 , +91 9580362555";s:5:"email";s:24:"contact@dpskalyanpur.com";s:7:"website";s:0:"";s:16:"branch_head_name";s:0:"";s:17:"branch_head_email";s:0:"";s:17:"branch_head_phone";s:0:"";s:8:"capacity";i:0;s:16:"current_students";i:0;s:10:"facilities";s:0:"";s:16:"special_features";s:0:"";s:6:"status";s:6:"active";s:10:"meta_title";s:0:"";s:16:"meta_description";s:0:"";s:13:"meta_keywords";s:0:"";s:8:"language";N;s:11:"language_id";s:1:"1";s:9:"school_id";s:1:"1";s:10:"created_at";s:27:"2025-09-12T11:06:58.387000Z";s:10:"updated_at";s:27:"2025-09-12T11:24:21.540000Z";s:4:"slug";s:11:"kalyanpur-2";s:4:"logo";s:0:"";}s:11:"blogdetails";a:1:{i:0;a:12:{s:2:"id";i:428;s:5:"title";s:94:"When Care Becomes Learning: How Wellness Counselling at DPS Kalyanpur Advances SDG 3 and SDG 4";s:11:"description";s:54659:"<p style="line-height: 1.7999999999999998; text-align: justify; margin-top: 12pt; margin-bottom: 12pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">At DPS Kalyanpur, the counsellor's room is part of the learning environment. Sessions help children manage anxiety, sleep fears, family tension and study pressure, while teaching emotional regulation and decision making. These skills support two UN goals, good health and quality education, because a child who feels safe and heard can focus, participate and persist.</span></p>
<h2 dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.7999999999999998; text-align: justify; margin-top: 18pt; margin-bottom: 6pt;"><span style="font-size: 16pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">Introduction</span></h2>
<p style="line-height: 1.7999999999999998; text-align: justify; margin-top: 12pt; margin-bottom: 12pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">A child who lies awake worrying, or who has stopped showing drawings to their parents, is in no position to concentrate on fractions. </span><span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: bold; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;"><a href="https://dpskalyanpur.com/" target="_self">School wellness counselling</a></span><span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;"> deals with that gap. At DPS Kalyanpur, our school counsellor meets students individually, works with parents and teachers and builds coping skills that last well beyond a single difficult term. This blog explains how these sessions support student mental health, teach life skills and connect to the two United Nations goals on well-being and quality education. It also walks through a real case and answers the questions parents ask most often.&nbsp; </span></p>
<h2 dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.7999999999999998; text-align: justify; margin-top: 18pt; margin-bottom: 6pt;"><span style="font-size: 16pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">What is School Wellness Counselling and How Does It Work At DPS Kalyanpur?</span></h2>
<p style="line-height: 1.7999999999999998; text-align: justify; margin-top: 12pt; margin-bottom: 12pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">School wellness counselling is structured emotional support offered to students inside the school day. At DPS Kalyanpur, the counsellor runs individual sessions. With their expertise, they draw up behaviour support plans and work alongside parents and teachers. The aim is simple- to notice problems early, teach coping skills and make asking for help feel ordinary instead of embarrassing.</span></p>
<p style="line-height: 1.7999999999999998; text-align: justify; margin-top: 12pt; margin-bottom: 12pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;"><span></span></span></p>
<ul style="margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 0; padding-inline-start: 48px;">
<li dir="ltr" style="list-style-type: disc; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre;" aria-level="1">
<p style="line-height: 1.7999999999999998; margin-top: 12pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">Individual sessions give each student a one-to-one space to talk through what is weighing on them</span></p>
</li>
<li dir="ltr" style="list-style-type: disc; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre;" aria-level="1">
<p style="line-height: 1.7999999999999998; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">Behaviour support plans set out small, practical steps that school and home can follow together</span></p>
</li>
<li dir="ltr" style="list-style-type: disc; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre;" aria-level="1">
<p style="line-height: 1.7999999999999998; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">Parent-teacher collaboration keeps the adults around a child working from the same picture</span></p>
</li>
<li dir="ltr" style="list-style-type: disc; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre;" aria-level="1">
<p style="line-height: 1.7999999999999998; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 12pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">Many issues look minor from outside, such as settling in after a move or building a morning routine, yet they shape how a child feels about school</span></p>
</li>
</ul>
<div>
<h2 dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.7999999999999998; text-align: justify; margin-top: 18pt; margin-bottom: 6pt;"><span style="font-size: 16pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">How Does School Wellness Counselling Support Student Mental Health?</span></h2>
<p style="line-height: 1.7999999999999998; text-align: justify; margin-top: 12pt; margin-bottom: 12pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">Counselling gives students primary-level psychosocial support, which is what SDG 3.4 asks schools to provide. The WHO describes mental health as a state of well-being in which every individual realises their potential. Sessions at DPS Kalyanpur move students towards that by spotting warning signs early, teaching coping skills and supporting behaviour change.</span></p>
<ul style="margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 0; padding-inline-start: 48px;">
<li dir="ltr" style="list-style-type: disc; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre;" aria-level="1">
<p style="line-height: 1.7999999999999998; margin-top: 12pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">WHO and UNESCO's Global Standards for Health Promoting Schools say school health services should include psychosocial support and counselling</span></p>
</li>
<li dir="ltr" style="list-style-type: disc; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre;" aria-level="1">
<p style="line-height: 1.7999999999999998; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">Counselling sits at the first level of support, where a worry can be handled before it grows</span></p>
</li>
<li dir="ltr" style="list-style-type: disc; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre;" aria-level="1">
<p style="line-height: 1.7999999999999998; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">Sessions also reduce the stigma around asking for help, which is often the biggest barrier for a child</span></p>
</li>
<li dir="ltr" style="list-style-type: disc; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre;" aria-level="1">
<p style="line-height: 1.7999999999999998; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 12pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">Each conversation adds to lifelong mental wellness, even when the concern seems small</span></p>
</li>
</ul>
<div>
<h3 dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.7999999999999998; text-align: justify; margin-top: 16pt; margin-bottom: 4pt;"><span style="font-size: 14pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">What does everyday DPS Kalyanpur mental health support look like?</span></h3>
<p style="line-height: 1.7999999999999998; text-align: justify; margin-top: 12pt; margin-bottom: 12pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">Most sessions deal with ordinary problems that feel enormous to the child. A student may be anxious after relocating from abroad, a younger child may be learning to sleep alone without fear, or a teenager may be trying to balance a passion with academics. Each case gets a plan matched to that child.</span></p>
<ul style="margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 0; padding-inline-start: 48px;">
<li dir="ltr" style="list-style-type: disc; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre;" aria-level="1">
<p style="line-height: 1.7999999999999998; margin-top: 12pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">Anxiety after a move from abroad, where the child needs time and reassurance to settle</span></p>
</li>
<li dir="ltr" style="list-style-type: disc; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre;" aria-level="1">
<p style="line-height: 1.7999999999999998; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">Bedtime fear, where gradual steps help a child sleep independently</span></p>
</li>
<li dir="ltr" style="list-style-type: disc; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre;" aria-level="1">
<p style="line-height: 1.7999999999999998; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">Passion versus academics, where the counsellor helps a student weigh both without dropping either</span></p>
</li>
<li dir="ltr" style="list-style-type: disc; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre;" aria-level="1">
<p style="line-height: 1.7999999999999998; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 12pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">Morning routines, for students who need to build independence</span></p>
</li>
</ul>
<div>
<h3 dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.7999999999999998; text-align: justify; margin-top: 16pt; margin-bottom: 4pt;"><span style="font-size: 14pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">How does a school counsellor spot warning signs early?</span></h3>
<p style="line-height: 1.7999999999999998; text-align: justify; margin-top: 12pt; margin-bottom: 12pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">A school counsellor sees patterns that individual adults can miss. Referrals from teachers, feedback from parents and follow-up sessions show when a child's mood, behaviour or friendships change. Catching these signals early lets the school step in with coping skills and support before the difficulty spreads into learning or life at home.</span></p>
<ul style="margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 0; padding-inline-start: 48px;">
<li dir="ltr" style="list-style-type: disc; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre;" aria-level="1">
<p style="line-height: 1.7999999999999998; margin-top: 12pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">Teachers refer students who seem short-tempered or withdrawn</span></p>
</li>
<li dir="ltr" style="list-style-type: disc; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre;" aria-level="1">
<p style="line-height: 1.7999999999999998; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">Parents share what they see at home, which fills in what school cannot see</span></p>
</li>
<li dir="ltr" style="list-style-type: disc; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre;" aria-level="1">
<p style="line-height: 1.7999999999999998; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">Follow-up sessions show whether a plan is working or needs to change</span></p>
</li>
<li dir="ltr" style="list-style-type: disc; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre;" aria-level="1">
<p style="line-height: 1.7999999999999998; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 12pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">Early identification makes talking to a counsellor routine, which lowers the stigma over time</span></p>
</li>
</ul>
<div>
<h2 dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.7999999999999998; text-align: justify; margin-top: 18pt; margin-bottom: 6pt;"><span style="font-size: 16pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">How Does Wellness Counselling In Schools Support SDG 4.7 and Quality Education?</span></h2>
<p style="line-height: 1.7999999999999998; text-align: justify; margin-top: 12pt; margin-bottom: 12pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">SDG 4.7 links quality education to life skills and counselling is where many of those skills get practised. Students learn to manage their emotions, make responsible decisions, resolve conflicts and understand themselves. A child who feels safe and heard can concentrate in class and stay with a task when it gets difficult.</span></p>
<ul style="margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 0; padding-inline-start: 48px;">
<li dir="ltr" style="list-style-type: disc; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre;" aria-level="1">
<p style="line-height: 1.7999999999999998; margin-top: 12pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">When school feels meaningful instead of like a chore, a child arrives in a different frame of mind each morning.</span></p>
</li>
<li dir="ltr" style="list-style-type: disc; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre;" aria-level="1">
<p style="line-height: 1.7999999999999998; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">Space to share her art without worrying about comparison gives a child real confidence.</span></p>
</li>
<li dir="ltr" style="list-style-type: disc; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre;" aria-level="1">
<p style="line-height: 1.7999999999999998; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">Steadier emotions show up as calmer classrooms and more stable friendships.</span></p>
</li>
<li dir="ltr" style="list-style-type: disc; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre;" aria-level="1">
<p style="line-height: 1.7999999999999998; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 12pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">These gains form the social-emotional base that academic learning sits on.</span></p>
</li>
</ul>
<div>
<h2 style="line-height: 1.7999999999999998; text-align: justify; margin-top: 16pt; margin-bottom: 4pt;"><span style="font-size: 14pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">Which life skills do counselling sessions teach?</span></h2>
<p style="line-height: 1.7999999999999998; text-align: justify; margin-top: 12pt; margin-bottom: 12pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">Counselling sessions at DPS Kalyanpur teach four life skills: emotional regulation, responsible decision making, conflict resolution and self-awareness. Students practise them on real situations from their own week, so the lessons feel useful instead of abstract. Over time these habits shape how a child studies and how they recover from a bad day.</span></p>
<div style="margin-left: 0pt;" align="left">
<table style="border: medium none currentcolor;" bis_size="{&quot;x&quot;:22,&quot;y&quot;:2873,&quot;w&quot;:596,&quot;h&quot;:368,&quot;abs_x&quot;:388,&quot;abs_y&quot;:3839}"><colgroup bis_size="{&quot;x&quot;:22,&quot;y&quot;:2873,&quot;w&quot;:595,&quot;h&quot;:367,&quot;abs_x&quot;:388,&quot;abs_y&quot;:3839}"><col width="189" bis_size="{&quot;x&quot;:22,&quot;y&quot;:2873,&quot;w&quot;:184,&quot;h&quot;:367,&quot;abs_x&quot;:388,&quot;abs_y&quot;:3839}"><col width="426" bis_size="{&quot;x&quot;:206,&quot;y&quot;:2873,&quot;w&quot;:410,&quot;h&quot;:367,&quot;abs_x&quot;:572,&quot;abs_y&quot;:3839}"></colgroup>
