</td>
<td style="vertical-align: top; padding: 5pt 5pt 5pt 5pt; overflow: hidden; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: solid #000000 0.5pt;" bis_size="{&quot;x&quot;:206,&quot;y&quot;:2986,&quot;w&quot;:410,&quot;h&quot;:85,&quot;abs_x&quot;:572,&quot;abs_y&quot;:3952}">
<p style="line-height: 1.7999999999999998; text-align: justify; margin-top: 10pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">A student weighs a shortcut against what it could cost</span></p>
</td>
</tr>
