<p style="line-height: 1.7999999999999998; text-align: justify; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">communication skills&nbsp;</span></p>
</li>
