<p style="line-height: 1.7999999999999998; text-align: justify; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 12pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">emotional resilience</span></p>
</li>
</ul>
<p style="line-height: 1.7999999999999998; text-align: justify; margin-top: 12pt; margin-bottom: 12pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">At DPS Kalyanpur, extracurricular activities are an integral part of the learning experience. Students are encouraged to participate in sports, performing arts, visual arts, clubs, leadership programmes, competitions and community initiatives that help them discover their strengths and develop life skills beyond the classroom. This balanced approach to education has made DPS Kalyanpur a preferred choice and the </span><span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: bold; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;"><a href="https://dpskalyanpur.com/" target="_self">best school in Kanpur</a> </span><span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">for parents seeking holistic child development.</span></p>
<p style="line-height: 1.7999999999999998; text-align: justify; margin-top: 12pt; margin-bottom: 12pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;"><span></span></span></p>
<h2 dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.7999999999999998; text-align: justify; margin-top: 18pt; margin-bottom: 6pt;"><span style="font-size: 16pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">7 Ways DPS Kalyanpur Builds Holistic Child Development Through Extracurricular Activities<span style="font-weight: 400;"> </span></span></h2>
<p style="line-height: 1.7999999999999998; text-align: justify; margin-top: 10pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">When you meet students of DPS, you find them strong, confident and outspoken&ndash;ready for all challenges. But how does that happen? It takes shape through focused emphasis on the following aspects:&nbsp;</span></p>
<h2 dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.7999999999999998; text-align: justify; margin-top: 18pt; margin-bottom: 6pt;"><span style="font-size: 16pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;"><strong id="docs-internal-guid-4533b72b-7fff-7e6e-b40a-81836b243dab" style="font-weight: normal;"></strong></span></h2>
<h3 dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.7999999999999998; text-align: justify; margin-top: 16pt; margin-bottom: 4pt;"><span style="font-size: 14pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">1. Building Discipline, Resilience and Wellbeing Through Sports</span></h3>
<p style="line-height: 1.7999999999999998; text-align: justify; margin-top: 12pt; margin-bottom: 12pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">Being the best school in Kanpur, DPS Kalyanpur ensures best <a href="https://dpskalyanpur.com/sports" target="_self">sports facilities</a> too. Sport is not physical education in the traditional sense but a few periods a week, some drills, an annual sports day. It is a professionally coached, multi-disciplinary programme. We treat it as a critical pillar of character development, emotional stability and mental wellbeing. The wide range of sporting options available ensures that every child, regardless of their physical inclinations, finds a discipline that fits them. And the competitive exposure, from inter-house level through to district, state and national tournaments, gives students real stakes to perform under.</span></p>
<ul style="margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 0; padding-inline-start: 48px;">
<li dir="ltr" style="list-style-type: disc; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre;" aria-level="1">
<p style="line-height: 1.7999999999999998; margin-top: 12pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">Over 15 sporting disciplines including football, cricket, basketball, badminton, athletics, swimming, table tennis, gymnastics, roll ball and skating</span></p>
</li>
<li dir="ltr" style="list-style-type: disc; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre;" aria-level="1">
<p style="line-height: 1.7999999999999998; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">Dedicated karate and taekwondo programmes with specialist trainers building self-confidence and physical focus alongside technical skill</span></p>
</li>
<li dir="ltr" style="list-style-type: disc; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre;" aria-level="1">
<p style="line-height: 1.7999999999999998; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">North West Sports Academy providing structured morning and after-school coaching sessions with professional instructors</span></p>
</li>
<li dir="ltr" style="list-style-type: disc; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre;" aria-level="1">
<p style="line-height: 1.7999999999999998; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 12pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">Regular inter-house matches, annual Sports Days and participation in district, state and national tournaments</span></p>
</li>
</ul>
<h3 dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.7999999999999998; text-align: justify; margin-top: 16pt; margin-bottom: 4pt;"><span style="font-size: 14pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">2. Developing Confidence and Self-Expression Through Performing Arts</span></h3>
<p style="line-height: 1.7999999999999998; text-align: justify; margin-top: 12pt; margin-bottom: 12pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">There is a specific kind of confidence that performance builds. It is the kind that comes from being seen, from being vulnerable in public and from discovering that you can hold a room's attention. This is different from the confidence of knowing the right answer in class. It is more durable and more visible in precisely the situations that matter most in professional life. DPS Kalyanpur has built dedicated infrastructure for performing arts and treats this dimension of student development with the same seriousness it brings to academic delivery.</span></p>
<ul style="margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 0; padding-inline-start: 48px;">
<li dir="ltr" style="list-style-type: disc; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre;" aria-level="1">
<p style="line-height: 1.7999999999999998; margin-top: 12pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">Specialised music and dance resource rooms providing formal training across Indian classical and contemporary forms</span></p>
</li>
<li dir="ltr" style="list-style-type: disc; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre;" aria-level="1">
<p style="line-height: 1.7999999999999998; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">Theatre programme covering the full spectrum of stagecraft including scripting, direction, stage design and performance</span></p>
</li>
<li dir="ltr" style="list-style-type: disc; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre;" aria-level="1">
<p style="line-height: 1.7999999999999998; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">Annual cultural festival Panorama serving as the primary showcase platform where students present their creative work at scale</span></p>
</li>
<li dir="ltr" style="list-style-type: disc; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre;" aria-level="1">
<p style="line-height: 1.7999999999999998; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 12pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">Opportunities to explore cultural identity and emotional intelligence through artistic expression across multiple disciplines</span></p>
</li>
</ul>
<h3 dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.7999999999999998; text-align: justify; margin-top: 16pt; margin-bottom: 4pt;"><span style="font-size: 14pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">3. Nurturing Leadership and Responsibility Through Student-Led Opportunities</span></h3>
<p style="line-height: 1.7999999999999998; text-align: justify; margin-top: 12pt; margin-bottom: 12pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">Leadership cannot be taught through instruction. It develops through repeated experience of genuine responsibility: coordinating people who did not choose to be coordinated, managing disagreement toward a shared goal and being accountable for outcomes that affect others. DPS Kalyanpur has built its house system specifically to create these experiences for as many students as possible, across as many different contexts as possible. The result is a school where leadership development is a culture.</span></p>
<ul style="margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 0; padding-inline-start: 48px;">
<li dir="ltr" style="list-style-type: disc; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre;" aria-level="1">
<p style="line-height: 1.7999999999999998; margin-top: 12pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">Six distinct houses: Bluebells, Daffodils, Iris, Orchid, Shamrock and Tulips, driving collective responsibility and competitive solidarity across the student body</span></p>
</li>
<li dir="ltr" style="list-style-type: disc; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre;" aria-level="1">
<p style="line-height: 1.7999999999999998; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">Student Council roles developing governance, public speaking and accountability through genuine institutional responsibility</span></p>
</li>
<li dir="ltr" style="list-style-type: disc; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre;" aria-level="1">
<p style="line-height: 1.7999999999999998; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">Model United Nations framework developing diplomatic thinking, structured argumentation and global awareness at a level the school is nationally recognised for</span></p>
</li>
<li dir="ltr" style="list-style-type: disc; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre;" aria-level="1">
<p style="line-height: 1.7999999999999998; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 12pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">NCC training providing military-style discipline, patriotism and a specific form of service-oriented leadership unavailable in most school environments</span></p>
</li>
</ul>
<h3 dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.7999999999999998; text-align: justify; margin-top: 16pt; margin-bottom: 4pt;"><span style="font-size: 14pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">4. Sparking Curiosity and Lifelong Learning Through Clubs and Innovation Labs</span></h3>
<p style="line-height: 1.7999999999999998; text-align: justify; margin-top: 12pt; margin-bottom: 12pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">The most motivated learning happens when a child chooses it. When they are not sitting in a subject because it is on the timetable, but engaging with something because it genuinely interests them. Specialised clubs and labs create exactly this condition, i.e., spaces where curiosity is the entry point and depth is the natural direction of travel. At DPS Kalyanpur, these spaces are genuinely diverse, genuinely equipped and genuinely used by students across the school.</span></p>
<ul style="margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 0; padding-inline-start: 48px;">
<li dir="ltr" style="list-style-type: disc; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre;" aria-level="1">
<p style="line-height: 1.7999999999999998; margin-top: 12pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">The Curiosity Lab ( a hands-on junior science facility) stimulates active scientific inquiry through experiential, discovery-based learning</span></p>
</li>
<li dir="ltr" style="list-style-type: disc; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre;" aria-level="1">
<p style="line-height: 1.7999999999999998; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">The Play Lab supports early education through cognitive development via structured play and exploration</span></p>
</li>
<li dir="ltr" style="list-style-type: disc; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre;" aria-level="1">
<p style="line-height: 1.7999999999999998; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">The Nyayarth Club and Books and Beyond Club provide philosophical and literary engagement outside regular academic blocks</span></p>
</li>
<li dir="ltr" style="list-style-type: disc; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre;" aria-level="1">
<p style="line-height: 1.7999999999999998; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 12pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">Robotics modules, Animation, Artificial Intelligence, Mass Communication and Fashion Studies available as future-ready disciplines within the curriculum</span></p>
</li>
</ul>
<h3 dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.7999999999999998; text-align: justify; margin-top: 16pt; margin-bottom: 4pt;"><span style="font-size: 14pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">5. Expanding Perspectives Through Global Exposure and International Experiences</span></h3>
<p style="line-height: 1.7999999999999998; text-align: justify; margin-top: 12pt; margin-bottom: 12pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">A child who has only ever encountered the world through a textbook understands it abstractly. A child who has visited Singapore, Japan, France, the UAE, or the UK as part of a structured educational experience understands it differently with the specific kind of confidence that comes from having navigated unfamiliar environments and discovered that the world is manageable, interesting and full of possibility. DPS Kalyanpur offers supervised international educational trips that connect global learning to lived experience in a way that no classroom can replicate.</span></p>
<ul style="margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 0; padding-inline-start: 48px;">
<li dir="ltr" style="list-style-type: disc; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre;" aria-level="1">
<p style="line-height: 1.7999999999999998; margin-top: 12pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">International educational trips to destinations including Singapore, Japan, France, the UAE and the UK</span></p>
</li>
<li dir="ltr" style="list-style-type: disc; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre;" aria-level="1">
<p style="line-height: 1.7999999999999998; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">Visits to global universities and cultural landmarks building aspirational awareness of higher education pathways</span></p>
</li>
<li dir="ltr" style="list-style-type: disc; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre;" aria-level="1">
<p style="line-height: 1.7999999999999998; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">Students develop self-reliance and cultural adaptability through direct, supervised international exposure</span></p>
</li>
<li dir="ltr" style="list-style-type: disc; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre;" aria-level="1">
<p style="line-height: 1.7999999999999998; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 12pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">Global perspective built through lived experience rather than described through curriculum content alone</span></p>
</li>
</ul>
<h3 dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.7999999999999998; text-align: justify; margin-top: 16pt; margin-bottom: 4pt;"><span style="font-size: 14pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">6. Cultivating Empathy and Social Responsibility Through Community Service</span></h3>
<p style="line-height: 1.7999999999999998; text-align: justify; margin-top: 12pt; margin-bottom: 12pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">Empathy is not built by reading about other people's circumstances. It is built by encountering them directly, by being present in a situation where another person's reality is genuinely different from yours and choosing to engage rather than observe from a distance. The community outreach initiatives at DPS Kalyanpur give students these encounters in structured, meaningful ways that develop social awareness and civic responsibility as genuine values rather than stated ones.</span></p>
<ul style="margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 0; padding-inline-start: 48px;">
<li dir="ltr" style="list-style-type: disc; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre;" aria-level="1">
<p style="line-height: 1.7999999999999998; margin-top: 12pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">&lsquo;We the Change&rsquo; programme engaging students directly in real-world problem-solving, fundraising and public health awareness for underprivileged communities</span></p>
</li>
<li dir="ltr" style="list-style-type: disc; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre;" aria-level="1">
<p style="line-height: 1.7999999999999998; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">Students encounter socioeconomic realities genuinely different from their own, developing perspective that academic learning cannot provide</span></p>
</li>
<li dir="ltr" style="list-style-type: disc; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre;" aria-level="1">
<p style="line-height: 1.7999999999999998; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">Community engagement developing the civic character that professional and social environments consistently reward</span></p>
</li>
<li dir="ltr" style="list-style-type: disc; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre;" aria-level="1">
<p style="line-height: 1.7999999999999998; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 12pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">A school culture where contribution to something beyond individual achievement is expected and celebrated as part of what it means to be a DPS Kalyanpur student</span></p>
</li>
</ul>
<h3 dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.7999999999999998; text-align: justify; margin-top: 16pt; margin-bottom: 4pt;"><span style="font-size: 14pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">7. Strengthening Academic Success Through Holistic Development</span></h3>
<p style="line-height: 1.7999999999999998; text-align: justify; margin-top: 12pt; margin-bottom: 12pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">This is the question parents most often ask quietly and least often hear answered honestly. Does all of this extracurricular investment come at the cost of academic results? The answer is a big no. In fact the evidence points in the opposite direction. Students who are genuinely engaged in sport, performing arts, leadership and community activities are more motivated, more focused and more resilient under pressure than those who are not. The development that happens outside the classroom directly strengthens what happens inside it.</span></p>
<ul style="margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 0; padding-inline-start: 48px;">
<li dir="ltr" style="list-style-type: disc; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre;" aria-level="1">
<p style="line-height: 1.7999999999999998; margin-top: 12pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">Physical activity improving concentration, cognitive function and emotional regulation that directly support academic performance</span></p>
</li>
<li dir="ltr" style="list-style-type: disc; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre;" aria-level="1">
<p style="line-height: 1.7999999999999998; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">Leadership and teamwork experiences developing the self-management and organisational skills that academic workload demands</span></p>
</li>
<li dir="ltr" style="list-style-type: disc; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre;" aria-level="1">
<p style="line-height: 1.7999999999999998; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">Performance experiences building the confidence and communication capability that examinations and university settings reward</span></p>
</li>
<li dir="ltr" style="list-style-type: disc; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre;" aria-level="1">
<p style="line-height: 1.7999999999999998; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 12pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">Community service developing the purpose and perspective that sustains motivation across the entire academic journey</span></p>
</li>
</ul>
<h2 dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.7999999999999998; text-align: justify; margin-top: 18pt; margin-bottom: 6pt;"><span style="font-size: 16pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">Conclusion</span></h2>
<p style="line-height: 1.8; margin-top: 12pt; margin-bottom: 12pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline;">The </span><span style="font-size: 12pt; background-color: transparent; font-weight: bold; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline;">best school in Kanpur</span><span style="font-size: 12pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline;"> does not have to choose between academic excellence and holistic development. DPS Kalyanpur has proven that the choice is a false one.</span></p>
<p style="line-height: 1.8; margin-top: 12pt; margin-bottom: 12pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline;">Sports activities that build character. Performing arts that build confidence. Leadership structures that build genuine accountability. Specialised clubs that build curiosity. Global exposure that builds perspective. Community service that builds empathy. All of it runs alongside strong academics as an equal partner in what the school produces.</span></p>
<p style="line-height: 1.8; margin-top: 12pt; margin-bottom: 12pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline;">Visit DPS Kalyanpur. Watch a Panorama rehearsal. Sit in on a MUN session. See the Curiosity Lab in use. Talk to the students.</span></p>
<p style="line-height: 1.8; margin-top: 12pt; margin-bottom: 12pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt; background-color: transparent; font-weight: bold; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline;">Then decide. <a href="https://dpskalyanpur.com/admission-overview" target="_self">Admissions are open</a>.</span></p>
<h2 dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.7999999999999998; text-align: justify; margin-top: 12pt; margin-bottom: 12pt;"><span style="font-size: 16pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">Your Queries Answered&nbsp;</span></h2>
<h3 dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.7999999999999998; text-align: justify; margin-top: 14pt; margin-bottom: 4pt;"><span style="font-size: 13pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">What Extracurricular Activities Ensure Holistic Child Development?</span></h3>
<p style="line-height: 1.7999999999999998; text-align: justify; margin-top: 12pt; margin-bottom: 12pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">Sports, performing arts, leadership programmes, MUN, NCC, robotics, AI, animation, specialised clubs, educational trips and community service initiatives support all-round development.</span></p>
<h3 dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.7999999999999998; text-align: justify; margin-top: 14pt; margin-bottom: 4pt;"><span style="font-size: 13pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">How Does a Sports Programme Develop More Than Physical Fitness?</span></h3>
<p style="line-height: 1.7999999999999998; text-align: justify; margin-top: 12pt; margin-bottom: 12pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">Through professional coaching and competitive exposure, students develop discipline, resilience, teamwork, confidence and sportsmanship alongside physical fitness.&nbsp;</span></p>
<h3 dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.7999999999999998; text-align: justify; margin-top: 14pt; margin-bottom: 4pt;"><span style="font-size: 13pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">How Does DPS Kalyanpur's House System Support Leadership Development?</span></h3>
<p style="line-height: 1.7999999999999998; text-align: justify; margin-top: 12pt; margin-bottom: 12pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">The six-house system, Student Council, MUN and NCC provide students with opportunities to lead, collaborate, communicate effectively and take responsibility in real-world situations.</span></p>
<h3 dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.7999999999999998; text-align: justify; margin-top: 14pt; margin-bottom: 4pt;"><span style="font-size: 13pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">Do Extracurricular Activities at DPS Kalyanpur Affect Academic Performance Negatively?</span></h3>
<p style="line-height: 1.7999999999999998; text-align: justify; margin-top: 12pt; margin-bottom: 12pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">No. Participation in sports, arts and leadership activities often improves focus, time management, confidence and discipline, which positively support academic performance.</span></p>
<h3 dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.7999999999999998; text-align: justify; margin-top: 14pt; margin-bottom: 4pt;"><span style="font-size: 13pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">What Makes DPS Kalyanpur a Strong Choice for Holistic Child Development?</span></h3>
<p style="line-height: 1.8; margin-top: 12pt; margin-bottom: 12pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt; background-color: transparent; font-weight: bold; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline;"><span style="font-weight: normal;"></span></span></p>
<p style="line-height: 1.7999999999999998; text-align: justify; margin-top: 12pt; margin-bottom: 12pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">DPS Kalyanpur combines strong academics with extensive opportunities in sports, arts, leadership, technology and community service, helping students develop skills beyond the classroom.</span></p>
<div><span style="font-size: 12pt; background-color: transparent; font-weight: bold; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline;">&nbsp;</span></div>
<div><span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">&nbsp;</span></div>
