<p style="line-height: 1.7999999999999998; text-align: justify; margin-top: 10pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;"><span style="font-family: Georgia;">Olympiad Examinations</span></span></p>
</td>
<td style="vertical-align: top; padding: 5pt 5pt 5pt 5pt; overflow: hidden; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: solid #000000 0.5pt;" bis_size="{&quot;x&quot;:214,&quot;y&quot;:2991,&quot;w&quot;:403,&quot;h&quot;:85,&quot;abs_x&quot;:580,&quot;abs_y&quot;:3957}">
<p style="line-height: 1.7999999999999998; text-align: justify; margin-top: 10pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;"><span style="font-family: Georgia;">Healthy competitive spirit and academic ambition beyond the classroom</span></span></p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr style="height: 39.25pt;" bis_size="{&quot;x&quot;:22,&quot;y&quot;:3076,&quot;w&quot;:595,&quot;h&quot;:85,&quot;abs_x&quot;:388,&quot;abs_y&quot;:4042}">
<td style="vertical-align: top; padding: 5pt 5pt 5pt 5pt; overflow: hidden; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: solid #000000 0.5pt;" bis_size="{&quot;x&quot;:22,&quot;y&quot;:3076,&quot;w&quot;:191,&quot;h&quot;:85,&quot;abs_x&quot;:388,&quot;abs_y&quot;:4042}">
<p style="line-height: 1.7999999999999998; text-align: justify; margin-top: 10pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;"><span style="font-family: Georgia;">Remediation and Acceleration</span></span></p>
</td>
<td style="vertical-align: top; padding: 5pt 5pt 5pt 5pt; overflow: hidden; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: solid #000000 0.5pt;" bis_size="{&quot;x&quot;:214,&quot;y&quot;:3076,&quot;w&quot;:403,&quot;h&quot;:85,&quot;abs_x&quot;:580,&quot;abs_y&quot;:4042}">
