</td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
</div>
<p style="font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif; line-height: 1.8; text-align: justify; margin-top: 12pt; margin-bottom: 12pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline;"><span></span></span></p>
<div><span><span style="font-size: 12pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline;"><span style="font-family: Georgia;">Sports at this level, such as cricket, football, basketball, badminton, athletics and yoga, are genuine developmental experiences, not managed crowd control. Teamwork, fitness and the character that comes from competition are built on these fields every day.</span><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, serif;"> </span></span></span></div>
<h3 dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.7999999999999998; text-align: justify; margin-top: 16pt; margin-bottom: 4pt;">&nbsp;</h3>
<h2><span style="font-size: 14pt; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;"><span style="font-family: Georgia;">Classes 9 and 10 - The Years That Shape Who They Are</span></span></h2>
<p style="line-height: 1.8; margin-top: 12pt; margin-bottom: 12pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline;"><span style="font-family: Georgia;">Before the academic day begins, something quietly important happens.</span></span></p>
<p style="line-height: 1.8; margin-top: 12pt; margin-bottom: 12pt;"><span style="font-family: Georgia;"><span style="font-size: 12pt; background-color: transparent; font-weight: bold; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline;">Morning prayer:</span><span style="font-size: 12pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline;"> A shared moment of stillness. It is not merely tradition but an anchor. Students who begin the day this way enter their first class differently. Individual anxiety gives way to collective purpose.</span></span></p>
<p style="line-height: 1.8; margin-top: 10pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline;"><span style="font-family: Georgia;">The morning enrichment period follows &mdash; sport, music, art and dance before the academic sessions start. Discipline and creativity are not lectured about here, but rather lived. </span></span></p>
<h3 style="line-height: 1.8; text-align: justify; margin-top: 12pt; margin-bottom: 12pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: bold; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;"><span style="font-family: Georgia;">What makes Classes 9 and 10 at DPS Kalyanpur distinctive:</span></span></h3>
<ul style="margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; padding-inline-start: 48px;">
<li dir="ltr" style="list-style-type: disc; font-size: 12pt; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre;" aria-level="1">
<p style="line-height: 1.8; margin-top: 12pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;"><span style="font-family: Georgia;">Interactive panels, hands-on experiments and SDG-linked interdisciplinary modules replace rote instruction</span></span></p>
</li>
<li dir="ltr" style="list-style-type: disc; font-size: 12pt; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre;" aria-level="1">
<p style="line-height: 1.7999999999999998; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><span style="font-family: Georgia;"><span style="font-size: 12pt; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: bold; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">Community service</span><span style="font-size: 12pt; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;"> is woven into student life to develop empathy that no examination can measure</span></span></p>
</li>
<li dir="ltr" style="list-style-type: disc; font-size: 12pt; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre;" aria-level="1">
<p style="line-height: 1.7999999999999998; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><span style="font-family: Georgia;"><span style="font-size: 12pt; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: bold; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">DEAR sessions</span><span style="font-size: 12pt; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;"> (Drop Everything And Read) carve out regular quiet time for deep reading. It is a habit that compounds into a lifelong relationship with ideas</span></span></p>
</li>
<li dir="ltr" style="list-style-type: disc; font-size: 12pt; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre;" aria-level="1">
<p style="line-height: 1.7999999999999998; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><span style="font-family: Georgia;"><span style="font-size: 12pt; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: bold; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">Research-based learning</span><span style="font-size: 12pt; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;"> develops investigation, collaboration and independent problem-solving as second nature</span></span></p>
</li>
<li dir="ltr" style="list-style-type: disc; font-size: 12pt; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre;" aria-level="1">
<p style="line-height: 1.7999999999999998; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><span style="font-family: Georgia;"><span style="font-size: 12pt; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: bold; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">MUN and Nyayarth Club</span><span style="font-size: 12pt; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;"> provide platforms for articulate debate and engagement with diverse perspectives</span></span></p>
</li>
<li dir="ltr" style="list-style-type: disc; font-size: 12pt; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre;" aria-level="1">
<p style="line-height: 1.7999999999999998; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><span style="font-family: Georgia;"><span style="font-size: 12pt; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: bold; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">Nukkad Natak</span><span style="font-size: 12pt; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;"> uses theatre to explore socially relevant issues. Thus, developing sensitivity that stretches beyond any academic subject</span></span></p>
</li>
<li dir="ltr" style="list-style-type: disc; font-size: 12pt; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre;" aria-level="1">
<p style="line-height: 1.7999999999999998; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 12pt;"><span style="font-family: Georgia;"><span style="font-size: 12pt; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: bold; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">Career Guidance and Counselling Cell</span><span style="font-size: 12pt; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;"> begins structured work here, mapping strengths, interests and pathways before the pressure of stream selection arrives</span></span></p>
</li>
</ul>
<p style="line-height: 1.8; text-align: justify; margin-top: 12pt; margin-bottom: 12pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;"><span style="font-family: Georgia;">Break time and social spaces are treated with intention too. Friendships form, social skills sharpen and students learn the art of belonging to something larger than themselves.</span></span></p>
<p style="line-height: 1.8; margin-top: 10pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline;"><span></span></span></p>
<h2 style="line-height: 1.7999999999999998; text-align: justify; margin-top: 16pt; margin-bottom: 4pt;"><span style="font-size: 14pt; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;"><span style="font-family: Georgia;">Classes 11 and 12 - Designing Their Own Future</span></span></h2>
<div>
<p style="line-height: 1.8; margin-top: 12pt; margin-bottom: 12pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline;">Senior school is where everything built across the previous years converges and where students begin taking real ownership of their direction.</span></p>
<h3 style="line-height: 1.8; margin-top: 12pt; margin-bottom: 12pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt; background-color: transparent; font-weight: bold; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline;">The curriculum is genuinely flexible:</span></h3>
<ul style="margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; padding-inline-start: 48px;">
<li dir="ltr" style="list-style-type: disc; font-size: 12pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre;" aria-level="1">
<p style="line-height: 1.8; margin-top: 12pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">Approximately 26 subjects across Science, Commerce and Humanities</span></p>
</li>
<li dir="ltr" style="list-style-type: disc; font-size: 12pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre;" aria-level="1">
<p style="line-height: 1.7999999999999998; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">Emerging fields alongside core disciplines: Artificial Intelligence, Entrepreneurship, Legal Studies, Fashion Studies</span></p>
</li>
<li dir="ltr" style="list-style-type: disc; font-size: 12pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre;" aria-level="1">
<p style="line-height: 1.8; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 12pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">Students design pathways that reflect their actual interests, not a fixed menu</span></p>
</li>
</ul>
<p style="line-height: 1.8; margin-top: 12pt; margin-bottom: 12pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt; background-color: transparent; font-weight: bold; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline;">The co-curricular ecosystem at senior level:</span></p>
<p style="line-height: 1.8; margin-top: 12pt; margin-bottom: 12pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline;">Nearly 18 active clubs shape life outside the classroom. These are not peripheral extras.</span></p>
<div style="margin-left: 0pt;" align="left">
