<p style="line-height: 1.7999999999999998; text-align: justify; margin-top: 10pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">Entrepreneurship Initiatives</span></p>
</td>
<td style="vertical-align: top; padding: 5pt 5pt 5pt 5pt; overflow: hidden; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: solid #000000 0.5pt;" bis_size="{&quot;x&quot;:212,&quot;y&quot;:5123,&quot;w&quot;:404,&quot;h&quot;:85,&quot;abs_x&quot;:578,&quot;abs_y&quot;:6089}">
<p style="line-height: 1.7999999999999998; text-align: justify; margin-top: 10pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">Innovation, real-world problem-solving, leadership</span></p>
</td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
</div>
<p style="line-height: 1.8; margin-top: 12pt; margin-bottom: 12pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline;">Educational visits to institutions like IIT labs and Sopan Ashram connect classroom learning to real professional environments. Students leave these visits understanding not just what fields look like from the outside but what working within them actually demands.</span></p>
<p style="line-height: 1.8; margin-top: 12pt; margin-bottom: 12pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline;">Career guidance at this level is specific and structured, including entrance timelines, college shortlisting, stream and subject mapping. Students leave DPS Kalyanpur knowing their options. And knowing themselves well enough to choose between them confidently.</span></p>
</div>
<h2 dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.7999999999999998; text-align: justify; margin-top: 18pt; margin-bottom: 6pt;"><span style="font-size: 16pt; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;"><span style="font-family: Georgia;">What a Day at DPS Kalyanpur Actually Adds Up To</span></span></h2>
<div>
<div>
<p style="line-height: 1.7999999999999998; text-align: justify; margin-top: 12pt; margin-bottom: 12pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">Every stage described above is the same school. The same philosophy, expressed differently at each age.</span></p>
<p style="line-height: 1.7999999999999998; text-align: justify; margin-top: 12pt; margin-bottom: 12pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">The Preschool child doing pottery on Earth Day and the Class XII student debating at MUN are both experiencing the same institutional commitment to learning that is real, to development that is whole, to an education that takes the person as seriously as the student.</span></p>
<div style="margin-left: 0pt;" align="left">
<table style="border: none; border-collapse: collapse;" bis_size="{&quot;x&quot;:22,&quot;y&quot;:5756,&quot;w&quot;:596,&quot;h&quot;:511,&quot;abs_x&quot;:388,&quot;abs_y&quot;:6722}"><colgroup bis_size="{&quot;x&quot;:22,&quot;y&quot;:5756,&quot;w&quot;:595,&quot;h&quot;:510,&quot;abs_x&quot;:388,&quot;abs_y&quot;:6722}"><col width="109" bis_size="{&quot;x&quot;:22,&quot;y&quot;:5756,&quot;w&quot;:105,&quot;h&quot;:510,&quot;abs_x&quot;:388,&quot;abs_y&quot;:6722}"><col width="143" bis_size="{&quot;x&quot;:128,&quot;y&quot;:5756,&quot;w&quot;:136,&quot;h&quot;:510,&quot;abs_x&quot;:494,&quot;abs_y&quot;:6722}"><col width="152" bis_size="{&quot;x&quot;:264,&quot;y&quot;:5756,&quot;w&quot;:145,&quot;h&quot;:510,&quot;abs_x&quot;:630,&quot;abs_y&quot;:6722}"><col width="221" bis_size="{&quot;x&quot;:409,&quot;y&quot;:5756,&quot;w&quot;:207,&quot;h&quot;:510,&quot;abs_x&quot;:775,&quot;abs_y&quot;:6722}"></colgroup>
