<h2><span style="font-size: 12pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline;">Frequently Asked Questions:</span></h2>
</div>
</div>
<h3 dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.7999999999999998; text-align: justify; margin-top: 14pt; margin-bottom: 4pt;"><span style="font-size: 13pt; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;"><span style="font-family: Georgia;">Q1. What is the rank of DPS Kalyanpur?</span></span></h3>
<div>
<div>
<div>
<p style="line-height: 1.7999999999999998; text-align: justify; margin-top: 14pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;"><span style="font-family: Georgia;">Ans. DPS Kalyanpur is widely recognised as one of the top CBSE schools in Kanpur. In 2025, it was ranked 1st in Kanpur, 2nd in Uttar Pradesh and 7th in India for Student Leadership Development by the EducationWorld Grand Jury Rankings.</span></span></p>
<span style="font-size: 12pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline;"><strong id="docs-internal-guid-5ee3cbe2-7fff-9215-3532-2cf6b8e3fa84" style="font-weight: normal;"></strong></span></div>
</div>
</div>
<h3 dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.7999999999999998; text-align: justify; margin-top: 14pt; margin-bottom: 4pt;"><span style="font-size: 13pt; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;"><span style="font-family: Georgia;">Q2. What makes DPS Kalyanpur Kanpur different from other CBSE schools in its approach to holistic education?</span></span></h3>
<p style="line-height: 1.7999999999999998; text-align: justify; margin-top: 12pt; margin-bottom: 12pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;"><span style="font-family: Georgia; background-color: transparent; font-size: 12pt;">Ans. </span><span style="font-family: Georgia;">DPS Kalyanpur combines academics, co-curricular activities, skill development and personality growth at every school stage. Holistic development is built into everyday learning, not treated as a separate activity.</span></span></p>
<h3 dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.7999999999999998; text-align: justify; margin-top: 14pt; margin-bottom: 4pt;"><span style="font-size: 13pt; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;"><span style="font-family: Georgia;">Q3. How does DPS Kalyanpur support students with different learning abilities?</span></span></h3>
<p style="line-height: 1.7999999999999998; text-align: justify; margin-top: 12pt; margin-bottom: 12pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;"><span style="font-family: Georgia; background-color: transparent; font-size: 12pt;">Ans. </span><span style="font-family: Georgia;">The school offers remedial support, acceleration programmes, Maths Lab learning and personality development sessions to support students at different learning levels.</span></span></p>
<h3 dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.7999999999999998; text-align: justify; margin-top: 14pt; margin-bottom: 4pt;"><span style="font-size: 13pt; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;"><span style="font-family: Georgia;">Q4. How does career guidance work at DPS Kalyanpur for Class 9 to 12 students?</span></span></h3>
<p style="line-height: 1.7999999999999998; text-align: justify; margin-top: 12pt; margin-bottom: 12pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;"><span style="font-family: Georgia; background-color: transparent; font-size: 12pt;">Ans. </span><span style="font-family: Georgia;">Career guidance starts from Classes 9 and 10 with stream selection support, counselling, college guidance, entrance preparation awareness and educational exposure visits.</span></span></p>
<h3 dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.7999999999999998; text-align: justify; margin-top: 14pt; margin-bottom: 4pt;"><span style="font-size: 13pt; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;"><span style="font-family: Georgia;">Q5. What is a typical morning like at DPS Kalyanpur across different school stages?</span></span></h3>
<div>
<div>
<div>
<p style="line-height: 1.8; margin-top: 12pt; margin-bottom: 12pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline;"><span style="font-family: Georgia; background-color: transparent; font-size: 12pt;">Ans. </span><span style="font-family: Georgia;">Students begin the day with activities like Circle Time, assemblies, prayer, sports, music and creative sessions before academics to create a positive and balanced start to learning.</span></span></p>
<div style="font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;"><span style="font-size: 12pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline;">&nbsp;</span></div>
