</li>
<li dir="ltr" style="list-style-type: disc; font-size: 12pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre;" aria-level="1">
<p style="line-height: 1.8; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 12pt;"><span style="font-family: Georgia;"><span style="font-size: 12pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">The </span><span style="font-size: 12pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">leading CBSE school in Kanpur</span><span style="font-size: 12pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;"> produces graduates who continue to perform because they continue to care</span></span></p>
</li>
</ul>
<h2 dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.8; text-align: justify; margin-top: 18pt; margin-bottom: 6pt;"><span style="font-size: 16pt; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline;"><span style="font-family: Georgia;">Comparing Academic Quality: What to Look for During a School Visit</span></span></h2>
<p style="line-height: 1.8; text-align: justify; margin-top: 12pt; margin-bottom: 12pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline;"><span style="font-family: Georgia;">When you visit DPS Kalyanpur, or any school you are considering, here is what to specifically assess for academic quality:</span></span></p>
<p style="line-height: 1.8; text-align: justify; margin-top: 12pt; margin-bottom: 12pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt; background-color: transparent; font-weight: bold; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline;"><span style="font-family: Georgia;">In the classroom:</span></span></p>
<ul style="margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; padding-inline-start: 48px;">
<li dir="ltr" style="list-style-type: disc; font-size: 12pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre;" aria-level="1">
<p style="line-height: 1.8; margin-top: 12pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;"><span style="font-family: Georgia;">Are teachers asking questions that require thinking or questions with single recalled answers?</span></span></p>
</li>
<li dir="ltr" style="list-style-type: disc; font-size: 12pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre;" aria-level="1">
<p style="line-height: 1.8; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;"><span style="font-family: Georgia;">Do students appear engaged and intellectually active or passively present?</span></span></p>
</li>
<li dir="ltr" style="list-style-type: disc; font-size: 12pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre;" aria-level="1">
<p style="line-height: 1.8; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 12pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;"><span style="font-family: Georgia;">Is the classroom atmosphere one of curiosity or anxiety?</span></span></p>
</li>
</ul>
<p style="line-height: 1.8; text-align: justify; margin-top: 12pt; margin-bottom: 12pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt; background-color: transparent; font-weight: bold; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline;"><span style="font-family: Georgia;">In the infrastructure:</span></span></p>
<ul style="margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; padding-inline-start: 48px;">
<li dir="ltr" style="list-style-type: disc; font-size: 12pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre;" aria-level="1">
<p style="line-height: 1.7999999999999998; margin-top: 12pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;"><span style="font-family: Georgia;">Are the labs, library and computer rooms in regular use during a normal school day?</span></span></p>
</li>
<li dir="ltr" style="list-style-type: disc; font-size: 12pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre;" aria-level="1">
<p style="line-height: 1.7999999999999998; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 12pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;"><span style="font-family: Georgia;">Does the infrastructure look maintained for regular use or preserved for visits?</span></span></p>
</li>
</ul>
<p style="line-height: 1.8; text-align: justify; margin-top: 12pt; margin-bottom: 12pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt; background-color: transparent; font-weight: bold; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline;"><span style="font-family: Georgia;">In the conversation:</span></span></p>
<ul style="margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; padding-inline-start: 48px;">
<li dir="ltr" style="list-style-type: disc; font-size: 12pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre;" aria-level="1">
<p style="line-height: 1.8; margin-top: 12pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;"><span style="font-family: Georgia;">Can the school tell you specifically where its graduates go: which colleges, which programmes, which competitive examinations they clear?</span></span></p>
</li>
<li dir="ltr" style="list-style-type: disc; font-size: 12pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre;" aria-level="1">
<p style="line-height: 1.7999999999999998; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;"><span style="font-family: Georgia;">Can it speak to its academic outcomes across subjects, not just its headline board results?</span></span></p>
</li>
<li dir="ltr" style="list-style-type: disc; font-size: 12pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre;" aria-level="1">
<p style="line-height: 1.8; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 12pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;"><span style="font-family: Georgia;">Is the fees structure explained completely and without evasion?</span></span></p>
</li>
</ul>
