<h3 dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.8; text-align: justify; margin-top: 16pt; margin-bottom: 4pt;"><span style="font-size: 14pt; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline;"><span style="font-family: Georgia;">2. How does DPS Kalyanpur prepare students for exams like JEE and NEET?</span></span></h3>
