</div>
<div><span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">&nbsp;</span></div>
<div>
<p style="line-height: 1.8; text-align: justify; margin-top: 12pt; margin-bottom: 12pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline;"><span style="font-family: Georgia;">A school that focuses only on co-curricular activities may create academically sharp students. Great at quizzes. Strong in debates. Confident with textbooks. But confidence on a stage? Team spirit on a football field? The grit that comes after losing a match? That may still stay missing.</span></span></p>
<p style="line-height: 1.8; text-align: justify; margin-top: 12pt; margin-bottom: 12pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline;"><span style="font-family: Georgia;">On the other side, a school that only celebrates extracurricular activities without strengthening academics misses the magic of balance. Because the real growth happens when both worlds work together.</span></span></p>
<p style="line-height: 1.8; text-align: justify; margin-top: 12pt; margin-bottom: 12pt;"><span style="font-family: Georgia;"><span style="font-size: 12pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline;">A </span><span style="font-size: 12pt; background-color: transparent; font-weight: bold; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline;">trusted school in Kanpur</span><span style="font-size: 12pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline;"> worth choosing does both. They invest in marks and mindsets. In academics and confidence. In building students who can solve equations in class and solve problems in life too.</span></span></p>
<h2 dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.8; text-align: justify; margin-top: 18pt; margin-bottom: 6pt;"><span style="font-size: 16pt; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline;"><span style="font-family: Georgia;">Top CBSE Schools in Kanpur With the Best Extracurricular Programmes</span></span></h2>
<p style="line-height: 1.8; text-align: justify; margin-top: 10pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline;"><span style="font-family: Georgia;">Here is a list of CBSE schools in Kanpur that go the extra mile to ensure 360 degree development of your child.</span></span></p>
<h3 dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.7999999999999998; text-align: justify; margin-top: 16pt; margin-bottom: 4pt;"><span style="font-size: 14pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">1. Delhi Public School, Kalyanpur</span></h3>
<p style="line-height: 1.7999999999999998; text-align: justify; margin-top: 12pt; margin-bottom: 12pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;"><span style="font-family: Georgia;">There&rsquo;s a reason the DPS name carries weight across India. Parents know what to expect. A certain standard. A certain structure. A school culture that usually takes academics and student development equally seriously.</span></span></p>
<p style="line-height: 1.7999999999999998; text-align: justify; margin-top: 12pt; margin-bottom: 12pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;"><span style="font-family: Georgia;">At DPS Kalyanpur, that framework translates into a campus where students are encouraged to explore beyond textbooks. The club culture here feels active, not decorative. Debate clubs debate. Science clubs build things. Student leadership actually exists outside annual functions and badge ceremonies.</span></span></p>
<p style="line-height: 1.7999999999999998; text-align: justify; margin-top: 12pt; margin-bottom: 12pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;"><span style="font-family: Georgia;">The biggest strength? Variety. Whether a child enjoys coding, theatre, quizzes, sports, or creative writing, there&rsquo;s usually a space where they can belong.</span></span></p>
<p style="line-height: 1.7999999999999998; text-align: justify; margin-top: 10pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;"><span style="font-family: Georgia;">What stands out:</span></span></p>
<p style="line-height: 1.8; text-align: justify; margin-top: 10pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline;"><span></span></span></p>
<ul>
<li><span style="font-size: 12pt; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;"><span><span style="font-family: Georgia; background-color: transparent; font-size: 12pt;">Strong DPS framework with consistent academic and extracurricular standards</span></span></span></li>
<li><span style="font-size: 12pt; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;"><span><span style="font-family: Georgia; background-color: transparent; font-size: 12pt;">Competitive environment without excessive pressure</span></span></span></li>
<li><span style="font-size: 12pt; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;"><span><span style="font-family: Georgia; background-color: transparent; font-size: 12pt;">Well-structured club culture with meaningful student participation</span></span></span></li>
<li><span style="font-size: 12pt; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;"><span><span style="font-family: Georgia; background-color: transparent; font-size: 12pt;">Activities across academics, sports, creativity, and technology</span></span></span></li>
<li><span style="font-size: 12pt; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;"><span><span style="font-family: Georgia; background-color: transparent; font-size: 12pt;">Facilities for athletics, swimming, karate, taekwondo, badminton, soccer, basketball, table tennis, and a gym. Adventure sports, including rope courses, are also included to develop resilience.</span></span></span></li>
<li><span style="font-size: 12pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline;"><span><span style="background-color: transparent; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Georgia;">Students can participate in dance (classical to contemporary), music (vocal and instrumental), and theatre. Art exhibitions are also held.</span></span></span></li>
<li><span style="font-size: 12pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline;"><span><span style="background-color: transparent; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Georgia;">'Panorama,' an annual festival, along with regular inter-house, inter-school competitions, and specialized assemblies.</span></span></span></li>
<li><span style="font-size: 12pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline;"><span><span style="background-color: transparent; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Georgia;">Through the 'Shiksha Kendra' initiative, students can engage in community service.</span></span></span></li>
<li><span style="font-size: 12pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline;"><span><span style="background-color: transparent; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Georgia;">A school culture that values involvement, not just ranks</span></span></span></li>
</ul>
<div>
<h3 dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.7999999999999998; text-align: justify; margin-top: 16pt; margin-bottom: 4pt;"><span style="font-size: 14pt; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline;"><span style="font-family: Georgia;">2. Allenhouse Public School, Khalasi Lines</span></span></h3>
<p style="line-height: 1.7999999999999998; text-align: justify; margin-top: 12pt; margin-bottom: 12pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline;"><span style="font-family: Georgia;">Some schools have sports facilities. Allenhouse has a sports culture. There&rsquo;s a difference. Here, sports do not feel like an extra period squeezed into the timetable. They feel woven into school life. Students are encouraged to participate seriously. Coaching, infrastructure, and opportunities are all visibly present.</span></span></p>
<p style="line-height: 1.7999999999999998; text-align: justify; margin-top: 12pt; margin-bottom: 12pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline;"><span style="font-family: Georgia;">What also works well is the balance. Alongside sports, students get exposure to creative and enrichment activities that build confidence, teamwork, and communication skills. And importantly, the facilities look used. Not just polished for brochure photos.</span></span></p>
<div>
