<p style="line-height: 1.7999999999999998; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">Co-curricular activities that strengthen academic skills</span></p>
