<p style="line-height: 1.8; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 12pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">A culture where achievement and personality development coexist</span></p>
</li>
</ul>
<div>
<h3 dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.7999999999999998; text-align: justify; margin-top: 16pt; margin-bottom: 4pt;"><span style="font-size: 14pt; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline;"><span style="font-family: Georgia;">5. Karam Devi Memorial Academy</span></span></h3>
<p style="line-height: 1.7999999999999998; text-align: justify; margin-top: 12pt; margin-bottom: 12pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline;"><span style="font-family: Georgia;">Karam Devi Memorial Academy takes a more balanced and inclusive approach to student development. Not every child wants to be a cricketer. Not every child enjoys public speaking either. And the school seems to understand that.</span></span></p>
<p style="line-height: 1.7999999999999998; text-align: justify; margin-top: 12pt; margin-bottom: 12pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline;"><span style="font-family: Georgia;">Sports, arts, and cultural programmes are all given visible importance here. Students who enjoy dance, music, visual arts, or cultural activities get genuine opportunities to participate and grow with confidence.</span></span></p>
<p style="line-height: 1.7999999999999998; text-align: justify; margin-top: 12pt; margin-bottom: 12pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline;"><span style="font-family: Georgia;">That balance matters, especially for children who may not immediately shine in traditional academic or athletic settings.</span></span></p>
<p style="line-height: 1.7999999999999998; text-align: justify; margin-top: 14pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline;"><span style="font-family: Georgia;">What stands out:</span></span></p>
<ul style="margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 0; padding-inline-start: 48px;">
