<p style="line-height: 1.8; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 12pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;"><span style="font-family: Georgia;">Encourages confidence through varied forms of participation</span></span></p>
</li>
</ul>
<div>
<h2 dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.7999999999999998; text-align: justify; margin-top: 18pt; margin-bottom: 6pt;"><span style="font-size: 16pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline;">What to Ask Any School About Its Extracurricular Programme</span></h2>
<p style="line-height: 1.7999999999999998; text-align: justify; margin-top: 12pt; margin-bottom: 12pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline;"><span style="font-family: Georgia;">A glossy brochure can say all the right things. The real answers usually come from the questions parents ask during the school visit. And the more specific the question, the more honest the picture becomes.</span></span></p>
<p style="line-height: 1.7999999999999998; text-align: justify; margin-top: 12pt; margin-bottom: 12pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline;"><span style="font-family: Georgia;">Here are a few that genuinely matter:</span></span></p>
<h3 dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.7999999999999998; text-align: justify; margin-top: 16pt; margin-bottom: 4pt;"><span style="font-size: 14pt; color: #434343; background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline;"><span style="font-family: Georgia;">About the programme itself</span></span></h3>
<ul style="margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 0; padding-inline-start: 48px;">
<li dir="ltr" style="list-style-type: disc; font-size: 12pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre;" aria-level="1">
<p style="line-height: 1.7999999999999998; margin-top: 12pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;"><span style="font-family: Georgia;">How many students actually participate in extracurricular activities? Can the school show real numbers?</span></span></p>
</li>
<li dir="ltr" style="list-style-type: disc; font-size: 12pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre;" aria-level="1">
<p style="line-height: 1.7999999999999998; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;"><span style="font-family: Georgia;">Are activities open to all children, or do only the &ldquo;already talented&rdquo; students get encouraged?</span></span></p>
</li>
<li dir="ltr" style="list-style-type: disc; font-size: 12pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre;" aria-level="1">
<p style="line-height: 1.8; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 12pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;"><span style="font-family: Georgia;">Do clubs, sports, music, and other programmes run consistently through the year or only before competitions and annual functions?</span></span></p>
</li>
</ul>
<h3 dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.7999999999999998; text-align: justify; margin-top: 16pt; margin-bottom: 4pt;"><span style="font-size: 14pt; color: #434343; background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline;"><span style="font-family: Georgia;">About the facilities</span></span></h3>
<ul style="margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 0; padding-inline-start: 48px;">
<li dir="ltr" style="list-style-type: disc; font-size: 12pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre;" aria-level="1">
<p style="line-height: 1.7999999999999998; margin-top: 12pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;"><span style="font-family: Georgia;">Can parents see the sports grounds, labs, music rooms, and activity spaces during a normal school day, not just during an organised tour?</span></span></p>
</li>
<li dir="ltr" style="list-style-type: disc; font-size: 12pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre;" aria-level="1">
<p style="line-height: 1.8; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 12pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;"><span style="font-family: Georgia;">Is the equipment modern and well-maintained, or does it feel like something the school hasn&rsquo;t invested in for years?</span></span></p>
</li>
</ul>
<h3 dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.7999999999999998; text-align: justify; margin-top: 16pt; margin-bottom: 4pt;"><span style="font-size: 14pt; color: #434343; background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline;"><span style="font-family: Georgia;">About student outcomes</span></span></h3>
<ul style="margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 0; padding-inline-start: 48px;">
<li dir="ltr" style="list-style-type: disc; font-size: 12pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre;" aria-level="1">
<p style="line-height: 1.7999999999999998; margin-top: 12pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;"><span style="font-family: Georgia;">What have students achieved recently in sports, debates, Olympiads, arts, robotics, MUNs, or competitions outside school?</span></span></p>
</li>
<li dir="ltr" style="list-style-type: disc; font-size: 12pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre;" aria-level="1">
<p style="line-height: 1.7999999999999998; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;"><span style="font-family: Georgia;">Do students regularly participate in inter-school, district, state, or national-level events?</span></span></p>
</li>
<li dir="ltr" style="list-style-type: disc; font-size: 12pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre;" aria-level="1">
<p style="line-height: 1.8; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 12pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;"><span style="font-family: Georgia;">By Class 12, what does a typical student&rsquo;s extracurricular profile actually look like?</span></span></p>
</li>
</ul>
<h3 dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.7999999999999998; text-align: justify; margin-top: 16pt; margin-bottom: 4pt;"><span style="font-size: 14pt; color: #434343; background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline;"><span style="font-family: Georgia;">About the school culture</span></span></h3>
<ul style="margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 0; padding-inline-start: 48px;">
<li dir="ltr" style="list-style-type: disc; font-size: 12pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre;" aria-level="1">
<p style="line-height: 1.7999999999999998; margin-top: 12pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;"><span style="font-family: Georgia;">Does the school encourage participation for every child, including shy or average students, or mainly celebrate the top performers?</span></span></p>
</li>
<li dir="ltr" style="list-style-type: disc; font-size: 12pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre;" aria-level="1">
