</li>
</ul>
<p style="line-height: 1.7999999999999998; text-align: justify; margin-top: 12pt; margin-bottom: 12pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline;"><span style="font-family: Georgia;">A genuinely good school in Kanpur will answer these questions clearly, comfortably, and with examples. If the answers feel vague, overly rehearsed, or defensive, that usually tells parents something important too.</span></span></p>
<div>
