<ul style="margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; padding-inline-start: 48px;">
<li dir="ltr" style="list-style-type: disc; font-size: 12pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre;" aria-level="1">
<p style="line-height: 1.7999999999999998; text-align: justify; margin-top: 12pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;"><span style="font-family: Georgia;">Confident</span></span></p>
</li>
<li dir="ltr" style="list-style-type: disc; font-size: 12pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre;" aria-level="1">
<p style="line-height: 1.7999999999999998; text-align: justify; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;"><span style="font-family: Georgia;">Creative</span></span></p>
</li>
<li dir="ltr" style="list-style-type: disc; font-size: 12pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre;" aria-level="1">
<p style="line-height: 1.8; text-align: justify; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 12pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;"><span style="font-family: Georgia;">Collaborative&nbsp;</span></span></p>
</li>
</ul>
<p style="font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif; line-height: 1.8; text-align: justify; margin-top: 12pt; margin-bottom: 12pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline;">Visit the school and watch the children. Trust what you observe and choose wisely!&nbsp;</span></p>
<h2 dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.8; text-align: justify; margin-top: 18pt; margin-bottom: 6pt;"><span style="font-size: 16pt; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline;"><span style="font-family: Georgia;">Your Queries Answered</span></span></h2>
<h3 dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.8; text-align: justify; margin-top: 12pt; margin-bottom: 12pt;"><span style="font-size: 14pt; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline;"><span style="font-family: Georgia;">1. What is the difference between co-curricular and extracurricular activities in CBSE schools?</span></span></h3>
<p style="line-height: 1.8; text-align: justify; margin-top: 12pt; margin-bottom: 12pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline;"><span style="font-family: Georgia;">Co-curricular activities support academics, like debates and Olympiads. Extracurricular activities include sports, arts, and clubs. Both help in overall development.</span></span></p>
<h3 dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.8; text-align: justify; margin-top: 16pt; margin-bottom: 4pt;"><span style="font-size: 14pt; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline;"><span style="font-family: Georgia;">2. Why are extracurricular programmes important when choosing a CBSE school in Kanpur?</span></span></h3>
<p style="line-height: 1.8; text-align: justify; margin-top: 12pt; margin-bottom: 12pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline;"><span style="font-family: Georgia;">They build confidence, teamwork, leadership, and creativity. These skills are essential for real-life success, not just exams.</span></span></p>
<h3 dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.8; text-align: justify; margin-top: 16pt; margin-bottom: 4pt;"><span style="font-size: 14pt; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline;"><span style="font-family: Georgia;">3. Which CBSE school in Kanpur has strong sports facilities?</span></span></h3>
<p style="line-height: 1.8; text-align: justify; margin-top: 12pt; margin-bottom: 12pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline;"><span style="font-family: Georgia;">Schools like DPS and Allenhouse Public School are known for good sports infrastructure. Visit the campus to assess actual usage.</span></span></p>
<h3 dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.8; text-align: justify; margin-top: 12pt; margin-bottom: 12pt;"><span style="font-size: 14pt; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline;"><span style="font-family: Georgia;">4. Do extracurricular activities affect a child's academic performance?</span></span></h3>
<p style="line-height: 1.8; text-align: justify; margin-top: 12pt; margin-bottom: 12pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline;"><span style="font-family: Georgia;">Yes, positively. They improve focus, time management, and motivation, which supports better academic performance.</span></span></p>
<h3 dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.8; text-align: justify; margin-top: 16pt; margin-bottom: 4pt;"><span style="font-size: 14pt; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline;"><span style="font-family: Georgia;">5. How do I assess the quality of a school's extracurricular programme during an admission visit?</span></span></h3>
<p style="line-height: 1.8; text-align: justify; margin-top: 12pt; margin-bottom: 12pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline;"><span style="font-family: Georgia;">Check participation levels, visit facilities during school hours, and ask about competitions and achievements. Look for consistent, year-round engagement.</span></span></p>
<span style="font-size: 12pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline;"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, serif;"><br><br><br></span></span></div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
