Kanpur, Gangpur Kachhar";s:4:"city";s:6:"Kanpur";s:5:"state";s:13:"Uttar Pradesh";s:7:"country";s:0:"";s:11:"postal_code";s:6:"208017";s:5:"phone";s:31:"+91 9044055605 , +91 9580362555";s:5:"email";s:24:"contact@dpskalyanpur.com";s:7:"website";s:0:"";s:16:"branch_head_name";s:0:"";s:17:"branch_head_email";s:0:"";s:17:"branch_head_phone";s:0:"";s:8:"capacity";i:0;s:16:"current_students";i:0;s:10:"facilities";s:0:"";s:16:"special_features";s:0:"";s:6:"status";s:6:"active";s:10:"meta_title";s:0:"";s:16:"meta_description";s:0:"";s:13:"meta_keywords";s:0:"";s:8:"language";N;s:11:"language_id";s:1:"1";s:9:"school_id";s:1:"1";s:10:"created_at";s:27:"2025-09-12T11:06:58.387000Z";s:10:"updated_at";s:27:"2025-09-12T11:24:21.540000Z";s:4:"slug";s:11:"kalyanpur-2";s:4:"logo";s:0:"";}s:11:"blogdetails";a:1:{i:0;a:12:{s:2:"id";i:489;s:5:"title";s:73:"Which Stream Is Best After 10th Class? A Complete Guide for CBSE Students";s:11:"description";s:107219:"<p style="line-height: 1.7999999999999998; text-align: justify; margin-top: 10pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><span style="font-family: Georgia;"><span style="font-size: 12pt; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;">Confused about which stream to choose after Class 10? This guide helps CBSE students understand Science, Commerce, and Arts: the career paths, subjects, and competitive exams linked to each. Learn how the </span><span style="font-size: 12pt; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: bold; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;"><a href="https://dpskalyanpur.com/" target="_self">best CBSE schools in Kanpur</a> </span><span style="font-size: 12pt; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;">prepare students to succeed in whichever stream they choose.</span></span></p>
<div><span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-style: italic; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;">&nbsp;</span></div>
<div>
<p style="line-height: 1.8; text-align: justify; margin-top: 12pt; margin-bottom: 12pt;"><span style="font-family: Georgia;"><span style="font-size: 12pt; background-color: transparent; font-style: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline;">Science. Commerce. Arts. These are the three doors open for every child&rsquo;s big decision. Parents discuss it at dinner. Friends compare plans. Relatives suddenly become career experts. And somewhere in the middle&hellip; a Class 10 student just wants clarity. So, why not take it from the </span><span style="font-size: 12pt; background-color: transparent; font-style: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline;">best CBSE schools in Kanpur?</span><span style="font-size: 12pt; background-color: transparent; font-weight: bold; font-style: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline;"> </span><span style="font-size: 12pt; background-color: transparent; font-style: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline;">Yes, here at DPS Kalyanpur, we help our students in every phase.&nbsp; This guide breaks down: subjects, career paths, competitive exams, and more. Let&rsquo;s make this decision simpler.</span></span></p>
<h2 dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.8; text-align: justify; margin-top: 18pt; margin-bottom: 6pt;"><span style="font-family: Georgia;"><span style="font-size: 16pt; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-style: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline;">The Big Decision After Class 10 for </span><span style="font-size: 16pt; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-style: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline;">Senior Secondary School</span><span style="font-size: 16pt; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-style: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline;"> Students&nbsp;</span></span></h2>
<p style="line-height: 1.8; text-align: justify; margin-top: 10pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt; background-color: transparent; font-style: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline;"><span style="font-family: Georgia;">Results arrive, and then comes the looming question: &ldquo;Science, Commerce, or Arts?&rdquo; It feels like a life-defining moment. You look around and find people saying how one is better than the other. But here is the truth: There is no superior stream. Each stream simply suits different kinds of learners. Yet many students still choose based on myths, such as</span></span></p>
<ul style="margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; padding-inline-start: 48px;">
<li dir="ltr" style="list-style-type: disc; font-size: 12pt; background-color: transparent; font-style: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; text-wrap-mode: nowrap;" aria-level="1">
<p style="line-height: 1.7999999999999998; text-align: justify; margin-top: 12pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; text-wrap-mode: wrap;"><span style="font-family: Georgia;">Science = top students</span></span></p>
</li>
