<h3 style="line-height: 1.8; text-align: justify; margin-top: 18pt; margin-bottom: 6pt;"><span style="font-size: 16pt; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline;"><span style="font-family: Georgia;">How to Choose the Right Stream</span></span></h3>
<p style="line-height: 1.8; text-align: justify; margin-top: 12pt; margin-bottom: 12pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline;"><span style="font-family: Georgia;">Still unsure about what stream to pick after class 10? Ask yourself four honest questions.</span></span></p>
<h3 dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.8; text-align: justify; margin-top: 16pt; margin-bottom: 4pt;"><span style="font-size: 14pt; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline;"><span style="font-family: Georgia;">1. Which subjects do you actually enjoy?</span></span></h3>
<p style="line-height: 1.8; text-align: justify; margin-top: 12pt; margin-bottom: 12pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline;"><span style="font-family: Georgia;">Marks matter, but interest matters more. If you like learning something even outside class, that&rsquo;s a clue. Science and Humanities often involve learning on field.&nbsp;</span></span></p>
<h3 dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.8; text-align: justify; margin-top: 16pt; margin-bottom: 4pt;"><span style="font-size: 14pt; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline;"><span style="font-family: Georgia;">2. Where are your strongest marks?</span></span></h3>
<p style="font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif; line-height: 1.8; text-align: justify; margin-top: 12pt; margin-bottom: 12pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline;"><strong>Look at Classes 9 and 10. Weigh the options and your performance (if you had given your best in these years). Patterns rarely lie.</strong></span></p>
<ul style="font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; padding-inline-start: 48px;">
<li dir="ltr" style="list-style-type: disc; font-size: 12pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; text-wrap-mode: nowrap;" aria-level="1">
<p style="line-height: 1.7999999999999998; text-align: justify; margin-top: 12pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; text-wrap-mode: wrap;"><strong>Strong math and logic - Science</strong></span></p>
</li>
<li dir="ltr" style="list-style-type: disc; font-size: 12pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; text-wrap-mode: nowrap;" aria-level="1">
<p style="line-height: 1.7999999999999998; text-align: justify; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; text-wrap-mode: wrap;"><strong>Interest in numbers and business - Commerce</strong></span></p>
</li>
<li dir="ltr" style="list-style-type: disc; font-size: 12pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; text-wrap-mode: nowrap;" aria-level="1">
<p style="line-height: 1.7999999999999998; text-align: justify; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 12pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; text-wrap-mode: wrap;"><strong>Love reading, writing, social ideas - Arts</strong></span></p>
</li>
</ul>
<h3 dir="ltr" style="font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif; line-height: 1.8; text-align: justify; margin-top: 16pt; margin-bottom: 4pt;"><span style="font-size: 14pt; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline;">3. What careers excite you?</span></h3>
<p style="line-height: 1.8; text-align: justify; margin-top: 12pt; margin-bottom: 12pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline;"><span style="font-family: Georgia;">If engineering or medicine seem like your passion, Science has to be your pick. Finance or business interests go well with Commerce. Law, media, civil services, and design options often demand an Arts background. So, think long term.</span></span></p>
<h3 dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.8; text-align: justify; margin-top: 16pt; margin-bottom: 4pt;"><span style="font-size: 14pt; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline;"><span style="font-family: Georgia;">4. Which exams might you take later?</span></span></h3>
