<h2 dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.7999999999999998; text-align: justify; margin-top: 4pt; margin-bottom: 4pt;"><span style="font-size: 16pt; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;"><span style="font-family: Georgia;">DPS, Kalyanpur: The CBSE School in Kanpur Parents Keep Choosing</span></span></h2>
<p style="line-height: 1.7999999999999998; text-align: justify; margin-top: 10pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><span style="font-family: Georgia;"><span style="font-size: 12pt; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;">Knowing the </span><span style="font-size: 12pt; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;">benefits of CBSE board</span><span style="font-size: 12pt; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;"> is one thing. Finding a school that actually delivers on them, that's another.</span></span></p>
<p style="line-height: 1.7999999999999998; text-align: justify; margin-top: 12pt; margin-bottom: 12pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;"><span style="font-family: Georgia;">At DPS, Kalyanpur, we follow the CBSE curriculum. Additionally, we&rsquo;ve built an entire learning environment around it. It is where every child gets the academic foundation CBSE promises, and every family gets the school experience they deserve.</span></span></p>
<h3 dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.7999999999999998; text-align: justify; margin-top: 16pt; margin-bottom: 4pt;"><span style="font-size: 14pt; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;"><span style="font-family: Georgia;">Academic Excellence That Actually Makes Sense to Children</span></span></h3>
<p style="line-height: 1.7999999999999998; text-align: justify; margin-top: 12pt; margin-bottom: 8pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;"><span style="font-family: Georgia;">Our teachers are trained to teach the way children learn, not the way textbooks are written. Concepts before memorisation. Understanding before application. Questions are encouraged before answers are given.</span></span></p>
<p style="line-height: 1.7999999999999998; text-align: justify; margin-top: 10pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;"><span style="font-family: Georgia;">The result? Students who don't just pass their CBSE examinations, they understand what they studied. And understanding, once built, doesn't need to be rebuilt for competitive exams.</span></span></p>
<h3 dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.7999999999999998; text-align: justify; margin-top: 16pt; margin-bottom: 4pt;"><span style="font-size: 14pt; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;"><span style="font-family: Georgia;">Holistic Development Because Marks Are Not the Whole Story</span></span></h3>
<p style="line-height: 1.7999999999999998; text-align: justify; margin-top: 12pt; margin-bottom: 8pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;"><span style="font-family: Georgia;">A child who only knows how to study is underprepared for the world.</span></span></p>
<p style="line-height: 1.7999999999999998; text-align: justify; margin-top: 12pt; margin-bottom: 8pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;"><span style="font-family: Georgia;">At DPS, Kalyanpur, every student has access to&nbsp;</span></span></p>
<ul style="margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 0; padding-inline-start: 48px;">
<li dir="ltr" style="list-style-type: disc; font-size: 12pt; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre;" aria-level="1">
<p style="line-height: 1.7999999999999998; text-align: justify; margin-top: 12pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; text-wrap-mode: wrap;"><span style="font-family: Georgia;">sports facilities</span></span></p>
</li>
<li dir="ltr" style="list-style-type: disc; font-size: 12pt; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre;" aria-level="1">
<p style="line-height: 1.7999999999999998; text-align: justify; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; text-wrap-mode: wrap;"><span style="font-family: Georgia;">performing arts</span></span></p>
</li>
<li dir="ltr" style="list-style-type: disc; font-size: 12pt; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre;" aria-level="1">
<p style="line-height: 1.7999999999999998; text-align: justify; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; text-wrap-mode: wrap;"><span style="font-family: Georgia;">debate</span></span></p>
</li>
<li dir="ltr" style="list-style-type: disc; font-size: 12pt; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre;" aria-level="1">
<p style="line-height: 1.7999999999999998; text-align: justify; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; text-wrap-mode: wrap;"><span style="font-family: Georgia;">student leadership programmes</span></span></p>
</li>
<li dir="ltr" style="list-style-type: disc; font-size: 12pt; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre;" aria-level="1">
<p style="line-height: 1.8; text-align: justify; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 8pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; text-wrap-mode: wrap;"><span style="font-family: Georgia;">robust co-curricular calendar</span></span></p>
</li>
</ul>
<p style="line-height: 1.7999999999999998; text-align: justify; margin-top: 12pt; margin-bottom: 8pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;"><span style="font-family: Georgia;">Because the skills built on a football ground, on a stage, or in a debate hall are the ones that show up in interviews, boardrooms, and life.</span></span></p>
<p style="line-height: 1.7999999999999998; text-align: justify; margin-top: 12pt; margin-bottom: 12pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;"><span style="font-family: Georgia;">This is what holistic education actually looks like- a daily lived experience!</span></span></p>
<h3 dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.7999999999999998; text-align: justify; margin-top: 16pt; margin-bottom: 4pt;"><span style="font-size: 14pt; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;"><span style="font-family: Georgia;">A Faculty That Invests in Each Child</span></span></h3>
<p style="line-height: 1.7999999999999998; text-align: justify; margin-top: 12pt; margin-bottom: 8pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;"><span style="font-family: Georgia;">What's best for a student? Personalised attention. We offer that for every student. There is extra support and enrichment for those who are ready to go further.</span></span></p>
<p style="line-height: 1.7999999999999998; text-align: justify; margin-top: 12pt; margin-bottom: 12pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;"><span style="font-family: Georgia;">Our teachers don't just teach subjects. They notice children. That noticing, catching a child before they fall behind, recognising a talent before it's named, is what separates a good school from one that truly changes lives.</span></span></p>
<h3 dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.7999999999999998; text-align: justify; margin-top: 16pt; margin-bottom: 4pt;"><span style="font-size: 14pt; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;"><span style="font-family: Georgia;">Infrastructure That Supports Serious Learning</span></span></h3>
<p style="line-height: 1.7999999999999998; text-align: justify; margin-top: 12pt; margin-bottom: 8pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;"><span style="font-family: Georgia;">Smart classrooms. Science and computer labs are equipped for hands-on exploration. A library that students actually want to spend time in. All in all, it is a campus designed to make learning feel less like an obligation and more like something worth showing up for.</span></span></p>
<p style="line-height: 1.7999999999999998; text-align: justify; margin-top: 10pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><span style="font-family: Georgia;"><span style="font-size: 12pt; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;">As one of the leading </span><span style="font-size: 12pt; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;">CBSE schools in Kanpur</span><span style="font-size: 12pt; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: bold; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;">,</span><span style="font-size: 12pt; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;"> we believe the environment a child learns in shapes the person they become.</span></span></p>
<h3 dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.7999999999999998; text-align: justify; margin-top: 4pt; margin-bottom: 4pt;"><span style="font-size: 14pt; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;"><span style="font-family: Georgia;">A Note on the </span></span><span style="font-family: Georgia; background-color: transparent; color: #000000; font-size: 14pt; white-space-collapse: preserve;">DPS Kalyanpur Fees Structure</span></h3>
<p style="line-height: 1.7999999999999998; text-align: justify; margin-top: 12pt; margin-bottom: 8pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;"><span style="font-family: Georgia;">We know fees matter. They're part of the decision and pretending otherwise doesn't help anyone.</span></span></p>
<p style="line-height: 1.7999999999999998; text-align: justify; margin-top: 10pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><span style="font-family: Georgia;"><span style="font-size: 12pt; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;">The <a href="https://dpskalyanpur.com/fee-structure-page-kalyanpur" target="_self"><strong>DPS Kalyanpur Fees Structure</strong></a></span><span style="font-size: 12pt; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;"> is designed to be transparent, competitive, and reflective of the quality of education your child receives. We don't believe in hidden costs or surprise additions mid-year.</span></span></p>
<p style="line-height: 1.7999999999999998; text-align: justify; margin-top: 12pt; margin-bottom: 8pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;"><span style="font-family: Georgia;">What you invest in your child's education at DPS, Kalyanpur, is what goes directly into the classrooms, the faculty, the infrastructure, and the programmes that shape their growth. Every rupee is accountable.</span></span></p>
<p style="line-height: 1.7999999999999998; text-align: justify; margin-top: 10pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;"><span style="font-family: Georgia;">For the most current and detailed DPS Kalyanpur fees structure, including grade-wise breakdowns and any scholarship or sibling benefits, we invite you to contact our admissions office directly or visit our campus. Our team will walk you through everything, honestly and completely.&nbsp;</span></span></p>
<h2 dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.7999999999999998; text-align: justify; margin-top: 18pt; margin-bottom: 6pt;"><span style="font-size: 16pt; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;"><span style="font-family: Georgia;">Key Takeaways: Why Many Kanpur Parents Prefer a CBSE School</span></span></h2>
<p style="line-height: 1.7999999999999998; text-align: justify; margin-top: 12pt; margin-bottom: 10pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;"><span style="font-family: Georgia;">Let's bring it all together. Here's what parents tell us, in their own words, reflected honestly.</span></span></p>
<ul style="margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 0; padding-inline-start: 48px;">
<li dir="ltr" style="list-style-type: disc; font-size: 12pt; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre;" aria-level="1">
<p style="line-height: 1.7999999999999998; text-align: justify; margin-top: 10pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; text-wrap-mode: wrap;"><span style="font-family: Georgia;">Because the syllabus is aligned with what their child will face next. JEE, NEET, CUET. The path is clear and the curriculum supports it.</span></span></p>
</li>
<li dir="ltr" style="list-style-type: disc; font-size: 12pt; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre;" aria-level="1">
<p style="line-height: 1.7999999999999998; text-align: justify; margin-top: 10pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; text-wrap-mode: wrap;"><span style="font-family: Georgia;">Because it travels well. CBSE's national standardisation means relocation doesn't derail a child's education.</span></span></p>
</li>
<li dir="ltr" style="list-style-type: disc; font-size: 12pt; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre;" aria-level="1">
<p style="line-height: 1.8; text-align: justify; margin-top: 10pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; text-wrap-mode: wrap;"><span style="font-family: Georgia;">Because the resources are everywhere. NCERT books, guides, coaching, online content&ndash; all abundant, all affordable.</span></span></p>
</li>
<li dir="ltr" style="list-style-type: disc; font-size: 12pt; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre;" aria-level="1">
<p style="line-height: 1.8; text-align: justify; margin-top: 10pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; text-wrap-mode: wrap;"><span style="font-family: Georgia;">Because it's balanced. Enough rigour to build strong students. Enough flexibility to let them be children, too.</span></span></p>
</li>
<li dir="ltr" style="list-style-type: disc; font-size: 12pt; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre;" aria-level="1">
<p style="line-height: 1.8; text-align: justify; margin-top: 10pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; text-wrap-mode: wrap;"><span style="font-family: Georgia;">Because the school matters, not just the board. And when they find a school like DPS, Kalyanpur, that brings the best out of the CBSE framework, the decision feels complete.</span></span></p>
</li>
</ul>
<h2 dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.7999999999999998; text-align: justify; margin-top: 12pt; margin-bottom: 12pt;"><span style="font-size: 16pt; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;"><span style="font-family: Georgia;">&nbsp;Your Queries Answered&nbsp;</span></span></h2>
<h3 dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.7999999999999998; text-align: justify; margin-top: 16pt; margin-bottom: 4pt;"><span style="font-size: 14pt; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;"><span style="font-family: Georgia;">Is CBSE better than ICSE for students in Kanpur?</span></span></h3>
<p style="line-height: 1.7999999999999998; text-align: justify; margin-top: 10pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><span style="color: #000000; font-family: Georgia; white-space: pre-wrap;"><strong>Ans -</strong> </span><span style="font-family: Georgia;"><span style="font-size: 12pt; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;">No board is universally better. But for students in Kanpur aspiring to competitive entrance exams like JEE or NEET, CBSE offers a more directly aligned curriculum. For families who may relocate, CBSE's national presence also makes transitions easier. The </span><span style="font-size: 12pt; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;">CBSE vs ICSE in Kanpur</span><span style="font-size: 12pt; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: bold; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;"> </span><span style="font-size: 12pt; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;">decision ultimately depends on your child's goals and learning style.</span></span></p>
<h3 dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.7999999999999998; text-align: justify; margin-top: 16pt; margin-bottom: 4pt;"><span style="font-family: Georgia;"><span style="font-size: 14pt; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;">What are the main </span><span style="font-size: 14pt; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;">benefits of CBSE board </span><span style="font-size: 14pt; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;">for Class 10 and 12 students?</span></span></h3>
<p style="line-height: 1.7999999999999998; text-align: justify; margin-top: 10pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><span style="font-family: Georgia;"><span style="font-size: 12pt; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;"><strong>Ans - </strong>The </span><span style="font-size: 12pt; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: bold; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;">benefits of CBSE board</span><span style="font-size: 12pt; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;"> for senior students include direct alignment with national competitive exams. An NCERT-based curriculum reduces coaching dependency. A structured assessment system prepares students for the pressures of high-stakes examinations progressively, not all at once.</span></span></p>
<h3 dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.7999999999999998; text-align: justify; margin-top: 16pt; margin-bottom: 4pt;"><span style="font-size: 14pt; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;"><span style="font-family: Georgia;">How is DPS, Kalyanpur, different from other CBSE schools in Kanpur?</span></span></h3>
<p style="line-height: 1.7999999999999998; text-align: justify; margin-top: 10pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><span style="color: #000000; font-family: Georgia; white-space: pre-wrap;"><strong>Ans -</strong> </span><span style="font-family: Georgia;"><span style="font-size: 12pt; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;">DPS, Kalyanpur, combines the strengths of the CBSE curriculum with a genuine commitment to holistic development. Small class attention, experienced faculty, modern infrastructure, and a rich co-curricular programme set it apart among</span><span style="font-size: 12pt; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: bold; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;"> </span><span style="font-size: 12pt; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;">CBSE schools in Kanpur.</span></span></p>
<h3 dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.7999999999999998; text-align: justify; margin-top: 16pt; margin-bottom: 4pt;"><span style="font-size: 14pt; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;"><span style="font-family: Georgia;">Can my child get into IIT or AIIMS from a CBSE school in Kanpur?</span></span></h3>
<p style="line-height: 1.7999999999999998; text-align: justify; margin-top: 10pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><span style="color: #000000; font-family: Georgia; white-space: pre-wrap;"><strong>Ans -</strong> </span><span style="font-family: Georgia;"><span style="font-size: 12pt; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;">Absolutely. Many IIT and AIIMS students come from </span><span style="font-size: 12pt; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;">CBSE schools in Kanpur</span><span style="font-size: 12pt; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;"> and across India. CBSE's alignment with JEE and NEET syllabi means students who build their fundamentals well at school have a strong foundation for these competitive exams.</span></span></p>
<h3 dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.7999999999999998; text-align: justify; margin-top: 16pt; margin-bottom: 4pt;"><span style="font-size: 14pt; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;"><span style="font-family: Georgia;">Which board is most preferred in India?</span></span></h3>
<p style="line-height: 1.7999999999999998; text-align: justify; margin-top: 10pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;"><span style="font-family: Georgia;"><strong>Ans -</strong> </span><span style="font-family: Georgia;">CBSE has to be it. It is the most widely followed board in India, known for its structured curriculum and emphasis on Science and Math.</span></span></p>
<div><span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;">&nbsp;</span></div>";s:9:"image_url";s:161:"https://myschool-assets.s3.ap-south-1.amazonaws.com/dps/blogs_images/1795591361_CBSE_vs_Other_Educational_Boards_Why_Many_Parents_in_Kanpur_Prefer_CBSE_copy.webp";s:14:"image_alt_text";s:21:"CBSE School in Kanpur";s:15:"last_updated_by";s:5:"10050";s:10:"created_at";s:27:"2026-11-25T07:22:41.597000Z";s:10:"updated_at";s:27:"2026-11-25T07:22:41.597000Z";s:7:"blog_id";s:2:"47";s:9:"branch_id";s:1:"9";s:9:"school_id";s:1:"1";s:13:"section_order";s:1:"1";}}s:10:"categories";a:0:{}s:3:"tag";a:10:{i:0;a:14:{s:2:"id";i:35;s:4:"name";s:11:"cbse school";s:11:"description";N;s:6:"status";s:6:"active";s:14:"publish_status";s:9:"published";s:10:"sort_order";i:0;s:5:"color";s:7:"#667eea";s:9:"school_id";s:1:"1";s:9:"branch_id";s:1:"9";s:11:"language_id";N;s:10:"created_at";s:27:"2026-02-18T07:29:18.017000Z";s:10:"updated_at";s:27:"2026-03-27T05:37:27.293000Z";s:4:"slug";s:10:"cbseschool";s:5:"pivot";a:2:{s:7:"blog_id";s:2:"47";s:6:"tag_id";s:2:"35";}}i:1;a:14:{s:2:"id";i:39;s:4:"name";s:18:"DPS primary school";s:11:"description";N;s:6:"status";s:6:"active";s:14:"publish_status";s:9:"published";s:10:"sort_order";i:1;s:5:"color";s:7:"#667eea";s:9:"school_id";s:1:"1";s:9:"branch_id";s:1:"5";s:11:"language_id";N;s:10:"created_at";s:27:"2026-03-14T10:43:03.977000Z";s:10:"updated_at";s:27:"2026-03-27T05:37:54.833000Z";s:4:"slug";s:18:"DPS primary school";s:5:"pivot";a:2:{s:7:"blog_id";s:2:"47";s:6:"tag_id";s:2:"39";}}i:2;a:14:{s:2:"id";i:41;s:4:"name";s:14:"Kanpur schools";s:11:"description";N;s:6:"status";s:6:"active";s:14:"publish_status";s:9:"published";s:10:"sort_order";i:0;s:5:"color";s:7:"#667eea";s:9:"scho