<p style="line-height: 1.7999999999999998; text-align: justify; margin-top: 12pt; margin-bottom: 12pt;"><span style="font-family: Georgia;"><span style="font-size: 12pt; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;">Further, students who experience different activities become adaptable, more confident and more self-aware. That is why the </span><span style="font-size: 12pt; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;"><a href="https://dpskalyanpur.com/" target="_self"><strong>best CBSE school in Kanpur</strong></a></span><span style="font-size: 12pt; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;"> focuses on holistic development. Not just marks.</span></span></p>
