<p style="line-height: 1.7999999999999998; text-align: justify; margin-top: 12pt; margin-bottom: 12pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;"><span style="font-family: Georgia;">A school that encourages communication does one powerful thing. It builds future-ready students.</span></span></p>
<h2 dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.7999999999999998; text-align: justify; margin-top: 14pt; margin-bottom: 6pt;"><span style="font-size: 16pt; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;"><span style="font-family: Georgia;">Look into Location and Accessibility&nbsp;</span></span></h2>
<p style="line-height: 1.7999999999999998; text-align: justify; margin-top: 12pt; margin-bottom: 12pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;"><span style="font-family: Georgia;">Convenience matters. But it should not be the first filter. Choosing a school only because it is nearby often means compromising on quality. That said, extremely long travel hours are not ideal either.</span></span></p>
