r the best CBSE schools in Kanpur with detailed fees, admission steps, facilities, and contact information to help parents make the right choice.";s:9:"image_alt";N;s:10:"main_title";s:63:"Parents Guide: Best CBSE Schools in Kanpur with Fees & Contacts";s:16:"main_description";s:152:"Discover the best CBSE schools in Kanpur with detailed fees, admission steps, facilities, and contact information to help parents make the right choice.";s:6:"school";a:29:{s:2:"id";i:1;s:4:"name";s:19:"Delhi Public School";s:11:"description";s:19:"Delhi Public School";s:4:"logo";s:0:"";s:7:"website";s:0:"";s:5:"email";s:0:"";s:5:"phone";s:0:"";s:7:"address";s:0:"";s:4:"city";s:0:"";s:5:"state";s:0:"";s:7:"country";s:0:"";s:11:"postal_code";s:0:"";s:14:"principal_name";s:0:"";s:15:"principal_email";s:0:"";s:15:"principal_phone";s:0:"";s:16:"established_year";N;s:13:"accreditation";s:0:"";s:7:"mission";s:0:"";s:6:"vision";s:0:"";s:11:"core_values";s:0:"";s:6:"status";s:6:"active";s:10:"meta_title";s:0:"";s:16:"meta_description";s:0:"";s:13:"meta_keywords";s:0:"";s:8:"language";N;s:11:"language_id";s:1:"1";s:10:"created_at";s:27:"2025-08-07T20:31:54.000000Z";s:10:"updated_at";s:27:"2025-12-13T17:21:25.200000Z";s:4:"slug";s:18:"delhi-public-scool";}s:6:"branch";a:30:{s:2:"id";i:9;s:4:"name";s:9:"Kalyanpur";s:11:"description";s:13:"Dps Kalyanpur";s:11:"branch_code";s:0:"";s:7:"address";s:66:"287-295, Bithoor Rd, Singhpur, Kalyanpur,
Kanpur, Gangpur Kachhar";s:4:"city";s:6:"Kanpur";s:5:"state";s:13:"Uttar Pradesh";s:7:"country";s:0:"";s:11:"postal_code";s:6:"208017";s:5:"phone";s:31:"+91 9044055605 , +91 9580362555";s:5:"email";s:24:"contact@dpskalyanpur.com";s:7:"website";s:0:"";s:16:"branch_head_name";s:0:"";s:17:"branch_head_email";s:0:"";s:17:"branch_head_phone";s:0:"";s:8:"capacity";i:0;s:16:"current_students";i:0;s:10:"facilities";s:0:"";s:16:"special_features";s:0:"";s:6:"status";s:6:"active";s:10:"meta_title";s:0:"";s:16:"meta_description";s:0:"";s:13:"meta_keywords";s:0:"";s:8:"language";N;s:11:"language_id";s:1:"1";s:9:"school_id";s:1:"1";s:10:"created_at";s:27:"2025-09-12T11:06:58.387000Z";s:10:"updated_at";s:27:"2025-09-12T11:24:21.540000Z";s:4:"slug";s:11:"kalyanpur-2";s:4:"logo";s:0:"";}s:11:"blogdetails";a:1:{i:0;a:12:{s:2:"id";i:506;s:5:"title";s:76:"Parents’ Guide to Best CBSE Schools in Kanpur: Fees, Admissions & Contacts";s:11:"description";s:35489:"<p style="line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 12pt; margin-bottom: 12pt;"><span style="font-size: medium;"><span style="font-family: Georgia, serif; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;">In this blog, we are going to cover everything parents need to know about choosing the </span><span style="font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; white-space-collapse: preserve; background-color: transparent; font-family: Georgia, serif; color: #000000; vertical-align: baseline;">B</span><span style="white-space-collapse: preserve; color: #000000; font-family: Georgia, serif;">est CBSE School in Kanpur</span><span style="font-family: Georgia, serif; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;">. We will explain why CBSE schools are a popular choice, how school fees are structured, and what the admission process looks like. The blog also helps parents understand what to check before selecting a school, such as teachers, facilities, location, and safety. By the end of this guide, parents will feel more confident in making the right school choice for their child.</span></span></p>
<h2 style="line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 12pt; margin-bottom: 12pt;"><span style="font-family: Georgia, serif; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: bold; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve; font-size: 13pt;">INTRO</span></h2>
<p style="line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><span style="font-family: Georgia, serif; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;"><span style="font-size: medium;">Having the right school for the bright future of your child is considered the most important decision for parents. School is not only for books and exams,therefore it is the place where your child will gain discipline, confidence, and values.&nbsp;</span></span></p>
<p><span><span style="font-size: medium;">&nbsp;</span></span></p>
