<h2 dir="ltr" style="font-size: 11pt; line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 18pt; margin-bottom: 4pt;"><span style="font-size: 17pt; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline;">FAQs&nbsp;</span></h2>
<p style="line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 12pt; margin-bottom: 12pt;"><span style="font-size: medium;"><span style="background-color: transparent; font-weight: bold; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline;">1. When should parents start applying for CBSE school admission in Kanpur?</span><span style="background-color: transparent; font-weight: bold; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline;"><br></span><span style="background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline;"> Parents should ideally begin the admission process between October and November to secure seats early.</span></span></p>
<p style="line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 12pt; margin-bottom: 12pt;"><span style="font-size: medium;"><span style="background-color: transparent; font-weight: bold; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline;">2. Are entrance tests compulsory for all classes?</span><span style="background-color: transparent; font-weight: bold; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline;"><br></span><span style="background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline;"> Entrance tests are usually required for higher classes, while Nursery and KG admissions focus more on interaction.</span></span></p>
<p style="line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 12pt; margin-bottom: 12pt;"><span style="font-size: medium;"><span style="background-color: transparent; font-weight: bold; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline;">3. Do CBSE schools in Kanpur offer transport facilities?</span><span style="background-color: transparent; font-weight: bold; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline;"><br></span><span style="background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline;"> Most reputed CBSE schools provide transport services with fixed routes and safety measures.</span></span></p>
<p style="line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 12pt; margin-bottom: 12pt;"><span style="font-size: medium;"><span style="background-color: transparent; font-weight: bold; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline;">4. How can parents verify a school&rsquo;s CBSE status?</span><span style="background-color: transparent; font-weight: bold; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline;"><br></span><span style="background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline;"> Parents can check the school&rsquo;s affiliation number on the official CBSE website or ask the school directly.</span></span></p>
<p style="line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 12pt; margin-bottom: 12pt;"><span style="font-size: medium;"><span style="background-color: transparent; font-weight: bold; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline;">5. Is it possible to change schools within CBSE later?</span><span style="background-color: transparent; font-weight: bold; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline;"><br></span><span style="background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline;"> Yes, CBSE allows school transfers, provided academic records and transfer certificates are in order.</span></span></p>
<div style="font-size: 11pt;"><span style="font-size: 11pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline;">&nbsp;</span></div>
</div>";s:9:"image_url";s:175:"https://myschool-assets.s3.ap-south-1.amazonaws.com/dps/blogs_images/1795595836_Parents%E2%80%99_Guide_to_Best_CBSE_Schools_in_Kanpur_Fees%2C_Admissions_%26_Contacts_copy.webp";s:14:"image_alt_text";s:26:"Best CBSE School in kanpur";s:15:"last_updated_by";s:5:"10050";s:10:"created_at";s:27:"2026-11-25T08:37:17.263000Z";s:10:"updated_at";s:27:"2026-11-25T08:37:17.263000Z";s:7:"blog_id";s:2:"32";s:9:"branch_id";s:1:"9";s:9:"school_id";s:1:"1";s:13:"section_order";s:1:"1";}}s:10:"categories";a:1:{i:0;a:14:{s:2:"id";i:6;s:4:"name";s:11:"CBSE School";s:11:"description";N;s:6:"status";s:6:"active";s:14:"publish_status";s:9:"published";s:10:"sort_order";i:0;s:9:"parent_id";N;s:9:"school_id";s:1:"1";s:9:"branch_id";s:1:"1";s:11:"language_id";N;s:10:"created_at";s:27:"2025-12-20T06:35:23.767000Z";s:10:"updated_at";s:27:"2025-12-20T06:35:23.767000Z";s:4:"slug";s:11:"cbse-school";s:5:"pivot";a:2:{s:7:"blog_id";s:2:"32";s:11:"category_id";s:1:"6";}}}s:3:"tag";a:4:{i:0;a:14:{s:2:"id";i:41;s:4:"name";s:14:"Kanpur schools";s:11:"description";N;s:6:"status";s:6:"active";s:14:"publish_status";s:9:"published";s:10:"sort_order";i:0;s:5:"color";s:7:"#667eea";s:9:"school_id";s:1:"1";s:9:"branch_id";s:1:"9";s:11:"language_id";N;s:10:"created_at";s:27:"2026-03-23T11:47:08.557000Z";s:10:"updated_at";s:27:"2026-03-27T05:36:00.113000Z";s:4:"slug";s:14:"Kanpur schools";s:5:"pivot";a:2:{s:7:"blog_id";s:2:"32";s:6:"tag_id";s:2:"41";}}i:1;a:14:{s:2:"id";i:42;s:4:"name";s:18:"Best school kanpur";s:11:"description";N;s:6:"status";s:6:"active";s:14:"publish_status";s:9:"published";s:10:"sort_order";i:0;s:5:"color";s:7:"#667eea";s:9:"school_id";s:1:"1";s:9:"branch_id";s:1:"9";s:11:"language_id";N;s:10:"created_at";s:27:"2026-03-23T11:47:28.300000Z";s:10:"updated_at";s:27:"2026-03-27T05:35:30.037000Z";s:4:"slug";s:18:"Best school kanpur";s:5:"pivot";a:2:{s:7:"blog_id";s:2:"32";s:6:"tag_id";s:2:"42";}}i:2;a:14:{s:2:"id";i:43;s:4:"name";s:20:"Top school in kanpur";s:11:"d